<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Joba</book>
  <para style="h">Joba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joba</para>
  <para style="mt">Joba</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz ramah mi pakhat a awm a, a hming chu Joba a ni. Chu mi chu sawisêlbo, Pathian ngaihsak tak, thil ṭha lo laka insûm thei mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fapa pasarih leh fanu pathum a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hausak dân chu hetiang hi a ni: berâm sângsarih, sanghâwngsei sângthum, bâwng tuak zanga, sabengtungpui zanga leh chhiahhlawh tam tak a nei a. Khawchhak mite zîngah chuan mi hausa ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fapate chuan mahni in ṭheuhvah ruai an inṭheh chhâwk ṭhîn a, an farnu pathumte chu an hnêna ei leh in tûrin an sâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutia an ruaiṭhehte an zawh chuan Joba chuan anni chu a ko va, a thian ṭhîn. Zîng takah a tho va, an hming kimin hâlral thilhlan a hlân ṭhîn. Joba chuan, “Ka fate hian thil sual tiin Pathian an lo sawichhiat tâk dahah,” a ti a ni. Joba chuan hetiang hian a ti ziah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, vântirhkohte Lalpa hmaa an inlan ni a lo thleng a. Setana pawh chu an zîngah a lo tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Khawi aṭangin nge i lo kal?” a ti a. Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, “A chhuk a chhova lei ka fan kual vêlna aṭangin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Ka chhiahhlawh Joba hi i hre chiang em? Lei chungah hian amah anga sawisêlbo, mi dik, Pathian ṭih mi, thil ṭha lo laka insûm thei an awm lo asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, “Joba chuan a chhan awm lovin a ngaihsak che em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Amah chu a in nên, a neih zawng zawng nên kil tinah i hual vêl tlat a ni lâwm ni? A kut hnathawh mal i sâwm a; tichuan, a ran rualte chu ram pumah an khat ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah, i kut lek la, a neih zawng zawng han lâksak teh mah, i hmaichhanah a sawichhe ngei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Aw le, tûnah a neih zawng zawng chu i kutah a awm e, amah tak erawh chu khawih suh ang che,” a ti a. Setana chu Lalpa hma aṭang chuan a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni khat chu a fanu leh fapaten an u ber ina chaw an eia uain an in lai chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joba hnênah zualko a lo tlân a, “Bâwngpaten lei an leha, sabengtungte kan kianga an tlat laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Seba miten min rawn bei thut a, chhiahhlawhte chu khandaihin an that a, rante chu min chhuhsak a, keimah chauh hi a hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêkin mi dang a lo tlân leh a, “Vân aṭangin Pathian mei a lo tla a, berâmte leh chhiahhlawhte a kâng ral vek a, keimah chauh hi a hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêkin mi dang a lo tlân leh a, “Kaldai-ho pâwl thuma insiamin sanghâwngseite chu an rawn bei a, an la vek a, chhiahhlawhte pawh khandaihin an that a, keimah chauh hi a hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak thei a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A la sawi lai mêkin mi dang a lo tlân leh a, “I fanu leh I fapaten an u ber ina chaw an eia uain an in laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ngai teh, thlalêr aṭangin thlipui a lo tleh a, in chu kil li-ah a rawn nam a, nula leh tlangvâlte chu a delh a, an thi ta vek mai. Kei chauh hi hrilh tûr chein ka lo chhuak thei a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chu a tho va, a kawrfual a pawtthlêr a, a lu a ziat kawlh a, lei si-a bawkkhupin Pathian a bia a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ka nu pum ata saruakin ka lo piang a, Saruak vêkin ka kîr leh dâwn a nih hi. Lalpa chuan a pe a, Lalpa chuan a la leh ta a nih hi, Lalpa hming chu fakin awm rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawngah hian Joba chu a sual lo, Pathian a sawichhe hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vântirhkohte Lalpa hmaa inlan hun a lo awm leh a, Setana pawh Lalpa hmaa inlan tûrin an zîngah a lo tel ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah, “Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih?” a ti a. Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, “A chhuk a chhova lei ka fan kual vêlna aṭangin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Setana hnênah chuan, “Ka chhiahhlawh Joba hi i hmu chiang em? Leiah hian amah anga sawisêlbo, mi dik, Pathian ṭih, thil ṭha lo laka insûm thei an awm lo asin. Chhan awm lova amah i tihchhiat ka phal hnu pawhin a la rinawm tlat a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Setana chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a, “Sa him nân meuh chuan min eng pawh an huam ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tûnah, i kut thawhin a ruh leh a tisa ngei han khawih teh, i hmaichhanah a sawichhe ngei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, Setana hnênah, “Aw le, amah chu i kutah a awm a, a nunna erawh chu zuah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Setana chu Lalpa hma aṭang chuan a chhuak a, Joba chu a kephah aṭanga a chhîp thlengin pânchhia a veitîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joba chu a chhuak a, inhiah nân bêl keh them a la a, vut zîngah a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nupui chuan a hnênah “I rilru ngai i pu reng dâwn em ni? Pathian sawichhia la, thi la a ni mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joba chuan a hnênah, “Nang hian hmeichhe â tak angin thu i sawi a nih hi. Pathian hnên aṭangin thil ṭha kan dawng a, thil ṭha lo pawh kan dawng lo vang em ni?” a ti a. Hêng zawng zawngah hian Joba chuan thu sual a sawi lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joba ṭhian pathumte chuan a chunga thil ṭha lo thleng chu an lo hria a, amah en tûrin mahni hmun ṭheuh aṭangin an lo kal a. Chûng mite chu Elifaza, Teman mi te, Bildada, Sua mi te, Zofara, Naama mi te an ni. Amah tuarpui leh thlamuan tûrin a hnêna kal hun an ruat angin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hla tak aṭangin an rawn thlîr a, an hre lo va, an râwl chhuahin an ṭap a; an puan an pawtthler a, an lu chungah vaivut an vânvawrh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, leiah ni sarih leh zân sarih an ṭhutpui a; tu mahin a hnênah thu kamkhat pawh an sawi lo. A tuar chu na êmin an hria a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Joba chu a lo ṭawng chhuak a, a pian ni chu ânchhia a lawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetiangin Joba chuan thu a sawi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pian ni chu boral rawh se, ‘Fapa a nei e,’ an tih zân nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi ni chu thimah lo chang se, Chung lam aṭangin Pathianin ngaihsak lo se, êng pawh a chungah êng suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lungngaihna leh thim chhah mup chuan An pualah hauh sela, Chhûmin khuh reng sela, Chhûn tithimtu chuan tithlabâr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu zân chu thim chhah mupin tuam tlat se, Chumi kuma nite zîngah tel ve lo se, Thla chhiarnaah pawh tel ve suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu zân chu zân khawhar lo ni se, Tah chuan hlimna au thâwm awm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ânchhe lawh thiamte chuan Chu ni chu ânchhia lawh sela, Leviathan thunun thiamte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thim hlim arsite lo thim sela, Êng zawng mah se, hmu suh se, Zîng khawvâr pawh hmu suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu zân chuan ka nu chhûl kawngka a lo khâr loh avâng leh Buaina min pumpelhtîr loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Engati nge chhûlah khân ka lo thih mai lohva, Ka pian chhuah hlima ka thaw a tâwp mai loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engati nge malchunga min chawia, Ka hnêk tûr hnutein min lo hmuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, ka mu ang a, ka reh riai ang a, Ka muhîl ang a, ka châwl hmiah tawh tûr;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei lalte leh rorêltute, Mahni tâna in ram dintute nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rangkachak tam tak nei lal fapate leh, An in tangkaruaa tikhattute nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Engati nge thi saa piang nau anga phûm bo ka lo nih loh, Nausên, êng hmu ta lo ang hian?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutah chuan mi sualten an chawk buai pha tawh lo va, Chaute an châwl tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tângte an châwl hahdam tawh ang a, Vêngtu vîn aw an hre tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tah chuan milian leh mitê an inang tlâng a, Chhiahhlawh pawh a pu lakah a fihlîm tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Engati nge hrehawm tuarten hrehawm an hmuh renga, Mi lungngaite an dam reng le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thih châk êm êm thi thei si lo, Ro phûm zawn aia nasa zâwka thih zawngtute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thi se hlim leh lâwm êm êm tûrte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kawng tinrênga Pathian dan beh tlat, Awm ngaihna hre tawh lote an dam reng le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chaw ka ei leh ka thaw a pik a, Ka rûm thâwm chu lui luang ri ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hlauhzâwng tak ka tawng a, Râpthlâk ka tih zâwng takin mi nangchîng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka thla a muang lo va, ka awm hle hle thei lo, Ka hah a dam lo va, ka buai deuh deuh ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elifaza, Teman mi chuan heti hian a han sawi a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“I hnênah thu kam khat sawi ila i hua ang em? Ngawih mai theih a ni bîk si lo va le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngaihtuah teh, mi tam tak i lo zirtîr a, Kut chak lote i lo tichak tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I thu chuan tlute a tungding a, Khûp zâwite a tichak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harsatna i chungah a lo thleng ve ta a, I chau ta dêr a, A han tlâkbuak che a, I buai chhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakhaw mi i nihna hian a thlamuan lo che em ni? I nun ngîl avângin i ngaih a ṭha chuang na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngaihtuah vang vang teh, Pawi khawih si lo tu nge chhiatna tâwka, Khawiah nge mi ṭha ngaihthah an nih i hriat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lo hmuh ve dân chuan, Tu pawh, khawlohna, lei anga leta, Buaina chi theh chuan a ngai vêk an seng leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin a thâwk khum a, an boral ṭhîn a, A thinurna thli chuan a chhêm bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sakeibaknei rûm te, sakeibaknei kawlh hâhum te a titâwp a, Sakeibakneituai hâte a tibal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sakeibaknei tar chu ei tûr tlachhamin a boral a, A pui no hruaite chu an tidarh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A rûk têin ka hnênah thu a lo thleng a, Ka beng bulah a rawn phun ser ser a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu chu mut ngheh hun lai takin Ka lo mangphan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlauvin ka khûr ta zawih zawih a, Ka tirilah min man a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlâ-in ka hmai a rawn thawi a, Ka hmulthi a ding sung sung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A han ding a; mahse, a hmêl ka hmu fiah thei lo, A riruang chu ka hmu a, A ngawi reng a, aw ka hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring hi Pathian hmuhin a fel tâwk em ni? A siamtu hmaah a thianghlim tâwk a maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A chhiahhlawhte pawh a ring zo lo va, A tirhkohte fel lohna pawh hmu ṭhîntu chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leia chêngte chu a va ring lo lehzual dâwn êm! Vaivuta siam mai an ni si a, Phêngphehlep anga râwp ral mai tûr an ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ni khat thil thuah an boral mai a, Tu khaw ngaihsak lohvin an ral hlen ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An neih zawng pawh a ral a, Fing chuang lovin an thi a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Han ko teh rêng, chhângtu tûr che an awm meuh vem? Mi thianghlim tu ber nge i pan dâwn teh rêng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi â chu vui reng chungin a thi a, Mi mâwl chu îtsîk nei reng chungin a boral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi â, inti ngêlnghet tak ka hmu a, Mahse, a chênna chu ânchhia ka lawh ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fate chu an him hauh lo vang a, An tiduhdah ang a, Rorêlnaah chuan an chhan lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rilṭâmten a buhbâl an eisak ang a, Hlînga a hungte pawh. A hausakna chu mi duhâmten an ît ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuarna hi vaivut aṭanga lo piang a ni lo va, Buaina pawh hi lei aṭanga chawr chhuak a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meisî chung lama a chho zêl ang hian, Mihring hi buai tûr rênga lo piang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei zawngin Pathian ka zawng ang a, Pathian hnênah ka chungthu ka thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chu thil ropui tak, hriat phâk rual loh te, Thil mak chhiar sên rual loh te titu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei chungah ruah sûrtîrin Lote chu tuiin a châwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutiangin mi tlâwmte chu a chawisâng a, Lungngaite chu a hnêm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bum hmangte thil ruahman a tihlawhchham a, An thiltih a puitling lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi fingte chu an fin vervêkna ngeiah an âwk a, Mi fing vervêk thil ruahmante chu engmahlovah a chantîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An tân chhûn êngah khua a thim a, Chhûn laiah pawh zân ang maiin an dap dun dun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An kâa khandaih lakah retheite chu a hum a, Mi chak kut ata a chhan chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, retheite chu beiseina a neihtîr leh a, Mi sualte erawh chu an kâ a huhsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathianin mi a thunun chu a nihlawh e, Chuvângin, Engkimtitheia thupêk chu ngainêp suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan a hliam a, a tuam leh ṭhîn. A kutin a tina a, a tidam leh ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vawi ruk vawi sarih pawh buaina tâwk la, A chhan chhuak ang che a, Thil ṭha lo chuan a khawih lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ṭâmpui mitthiah a chhanhim ang che a, Indonaah pawh khandaih lakah a hum ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭawng na tak lakah a vêng ang che a, Chhiatna lo thleng pawh i hlau lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chhiatna lo thleng leh ṭâm tla chu i nuihsan mai ang a, Ram sakawlhte pawh i hlau lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lovah lung a awm tawh lo vang a, Ram sakawlhte pawhin an rawn khawih lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I puan inah râlmuang takin i awm ang a, I berâm huang i tlawh pawhin kim lo a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I thlah tam tak i hmu phâk ang a, I rîla rahte chu ram hnim angin an tlim hmur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A hun taka buhphal an seng angin Tarkûna damin thlânah i liam ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngaihtuah chiang teh, han chhût ngun la, Chutiang ngei chu a lo ni. Ngai ngun la, i ṭhat phah mahna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Joba chuan a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka manganna leh vanduaina hi teh theih ni se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipui ṭiau aiin a rit zâwk ang, Chuvâng chuan, ka thu a bung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engkimtitheia thal chuan min chhun a, A tûr chuan mi fan chhuak a, Pathian hlauhnain ka khat ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram sabengtung chu hlobet a peh laiin A hrâm ngai em ni? Bâwngpa pawh buhpâwl a ei Laiin a bû em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hânna nei lo chu chi tel lovin a ei tlâk em ni? Artui pâwn vâr a hâng em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutiang chaw chu châkna rêng ka nei lo, Mi ngei hluah hluah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, ka dîl chu hmu thei teh ila, Pathianin ka duhzâwng chu min pe teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathianin mi râwtsawm vek duhin A kut thawhin min tan chhûm hmawk mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin ka thla a la muang cheu vang, Mi zuah lovin na tuar nek mah ila, Ka lâwm zêl ang, Mi Thianghlima thu chu ka pênsan si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thlâkhlelh tlâk chakna eng nge ka neih? Beisei leh chuan tûr nei si lovin engah nge ka dam reng?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lung anga sak em ka nih? Ka tisa pawh ngên ang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahni inchhan thei rual ka ni ta lo, Ka thiltihtheihna a bo zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engkimtitheia hawisan mah se, Mangan tâwpah miin ṭhian ṭha an mamawh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka unaute erawh zawng, Kawrte rum anga bumhmang, Ṭhâla kangchat mai ṭhîn ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Luipui, vûr tuia dum kûk, Vûr tlang inphûm rûkna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khua a lo luma tuirala, Nipuia kangchat ta ṭhîn ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khualzinte chu tui zawngin an vâk kual an vâk kual a, Thlalêrah chuan vâkin an boral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Teman sumdâwng rualte pawhin an zawng a, Seba khualzinte phei chuan hmuh ngei an beisei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Beisei taka an zawn chu an hlawhchham a, Hrilhhai takin an kal ta ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka chungah chutiang chu in ni, Ka hrehawm tuar min hmu a, in hlau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thilpêk dîl che uin, ‘In sum leh pai a thlâwnin min pe teh u’ ka ti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmêlma kut ata min chhan chhuak tûrin emaw Ka ngên che u em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Min zirtîr ula, ka lo ngaithla ang e, Ka dik lohna min hrilh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thu dik hian mi a hneh ṭhîn, Mahse, min hnialna hi hnialhrât thu mai a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hnial hrât hrim hrima min ngaiin, Mangang taka ka thu sawi hi sawi mai maiah min ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Fahrahte chu in lilâm duh a, In ṭhian bulte meuh pawh in hralh duh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tûnah mi han en teh u, In hmaichhanah ka daw lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lamlêt ula, thil dik lo ti suh u, Ka thu ngaihtuah ṭha rawh u, ka thu hi a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka sawiah hian eng nge dik lo awm? Thil ṭha lo chu ka thliar hrang thei lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leiah mihring hi hna hahthlâk tak thawk tûr a ni lo vem ni? A damchhûng chu inhlawhfa ang maia thawk tûr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chhiahhlawh, tlai ni nêm nghâkhlel tak ang, Inhlawhfa, a hlawh tûr thlîr reng ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thla têlin ka bei a dawng tial tial a, Zan tinin ka hah hluah hluah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka han mu a, engtikah harh leh tak ang i maw ka ti a, Mahse, zankhuain ka let ka let a, Khawvâr hlân ka nghâkhlel êm êm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka taksa a pumin a pân lung nuai nuai a, A khir luai a, a khawk a, a hnai ṭuam ṭuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng nite chu puantahtu khawhthei aiin a liam rang a, Beisei tûr nei lovin a liam mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nunna hi thli ang lek a nih hre reng la, Ka mit hian thil ṭha a hmu lo mai dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûna mi hmutu hian mi hmu tawh dâwn lo va, Min hmuh tum mah se hmuh tûr ka awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhûm a kiang a, a ral ṭhîn ang hian, Thlâna lût tawh chu an kîr leh ngai lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In lamah a lo hâwng tawh lo vang a, Tu man an hre reng tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, insûmkâr lovin ka ṭawng ang a, Lungchhe takin ka sawi dâwn e, Rilru na takin ka phun dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuipui nge maw ka niha tuipui sakawlh? Min vêng tlat tûr i ruat tâk hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khumah ka mu hahdam ang a, muhîl ila, Ka na a nuam deuh mahna ka tih leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangin mang hlauhawm pui pui min neihtîr a, Thil râpthlâk tak tak min hmuhtîr si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetia na tuara dam reng ai chuan Reh hlum hial ka thlang zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nun hi ka ning takzet a, Dam rei ka duh tawh lo, Min kalsan rawh u, mûmal ka nei tawh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring hi eng nge maw a niha, i ngaihmawha, I ngaihsak hle le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tûk tin i kana, Eng lai pawhin i fiah ṭhîn hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khaw dang hawi lo lêkin, chil lem chhûng takngial pawh Min en lovin i awm ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang, mihringte vêngtu, Ka sual a nih pawhin eng nge ka tihsuala, Ninawm khawpa min en bîk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Engah nge ka bawhchhiatna i ngaihdam lohva, Ka khawlohna i lâk bo mai loh le? Kei zawng ka thi thuai dâwn a, Min zawng mah la, ka awm lo mai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Bildada, Sua mi chuan heti hian a sawi ve a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng chen nge hêng hi i sawi dâwn? I va han ṭawng rum ve?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathianin a rêl tawh chu a tidanglam ngai em ni? Engkimtitheia chuan a dik chu a sawhsawn dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I fate a chungah an sual a nih chuan An sual man a tuartîr ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tihtakzeta Pathian i zawna, Tihtakmeuhva Engkimtitheia i dîl chuan, Anin a rawn ngaihsak ngei ang che a, Mal a sâwm ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thianghlim leh dik taka i nun phawt chuan, A rawn ngaihsak ngei ang che a, Mal a sâwm bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I bul ṭanna tê hle mah se, I hun hnuhnûngah tihropui i ni ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmânlai nite kha han dâwn kîr la, An pi pute thil hriatte kha chhui chiang teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimina mi ang lek kan ni a, eng mah kan lo hre lo, Kan lei nun hi a tawi hle si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng mite chuan an lo zirtîr ang che a, An thil hriatte chu an lo hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chirhdûp lovah pumphîr a ṭo ngai em ni? Tui awm lohnaah phairuang a ṭo thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sah tliah lohvin duah hle pawh ni se, Thlai dangte aiin a vuai hma ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian pawisa lote chu chutiang chuan an awm ang a, Pathian ngaihsak lote chu an beidawng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An innghahna chu a derdêp êm êm a, Maimawm rîl ang lek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu chu nghêng sela a sâwt dâwn em ni? Vuan sela a tuar dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi sual chu, thlai, ni êng hmu ṭha, duah hluah hluah Pêng ṭuam ṭuam ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lung keh kârah zung a thlâk a, Lungah chuan zung a kaih tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mahse, an pawh phawn hnu chuan Tu man a awmna rêng an hre tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai teh, hei hi mi sual hlimna awm chhun chu a ni mai; Mi dangin a hmun an rawn luah dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, Pathianin mi ṭha a paihthla lo vang a, Thil sual titute a tungding hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlim takin a nuihtîr leh ang che a, Lâwm takin i awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I hmêlmate chu zakin an kun reng ang a, Mi suaksualte chênna in pawh a awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joba chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I sawite chu a dik tih ka hria. Mahse, Pathian mit hmuhin mihring hi a dik tâwk thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian chu hnial dâwn ta sela, Vawi sângah vawi khat pawh a hnial hneh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chu finnaa khat, engkim tithei a ni, Amah dodâl ṭhîn tu mah hmuingîl an awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hriat loh hlânin tlângte a sawn a, A thinur chângin a tichhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei chu a awmna hmunah a sâwi nghîng a, A nghahchhan bante chu a nghîng dur dur a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni chu thu a pe a, a chhuahtîr lo va, Arsite pawh a khuh vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahni chauhvin vân khi a kaipharh a, Tuifâwnte pawh a rap bet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zângkhua te, chhohreivûng te, siruk te, Chhim lam arsi bâwr te khi a siam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil ropui chhui chhuah rual loh te, Thil mak chhui sên lohte titu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka bulah a lo kal a, ka hmu si lo, Min kal pêl a, ka hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, a duh apiang a lâk pawhin tu nge dâl thei? ‘Eng nge i tih’ a hnênah tu nge ti ngam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin a thinur a sût lo vang, Rahab puitu, a hmêlmate chu a rapbet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engtin nge kei tehlul hian ani chu ka chhân anga, Ka hnial thiam tehlul ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dik mah ila, ani chu ka chhâng lo vang, Ka chunga thuneitu chu khawngaih ka dîl zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka au va, anin a lo hria a nih pawhin Ka thu a dawnsawn ka ring chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlipui hmangin min nuai nek a, Chhan awm lovin min hliam belhchhah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thaw la hman lêk lovin min siam a, Hrehawmna hlîrin ka khat ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chak zâwngah chuan tu nge tluk ang? Inkhing dâwn ila, tu nge do pha ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sual inti lo mah ila, ka ṭawngkamin thiam loh mi chantîr a, Demawm lo ni mah ila, ka dik lohna a hmu tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sawisêlbo pawh ni ila, ka inngaisâng chuang lo, Ka nun hi ka ngainêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvâng alâwm, mi ṭha leh mi sual pawh Thuhmun vekin a tiboral dâwn ka tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thil ṭha lovin thihna a thlentîr thut a, Mi dik mangang chu Pathianin a nuih ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khawvêl hi mi sual kuta pêk a ni a, Rorêltute mit pawh tihdel a ni; A tih ni lo se, tu tih nge ni ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka damchhûng nite hi a liam thuai a, Thil ṭha tawng lovin a ral mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lawng chak tak angin a kal liam a, Mupui sa hmu bir ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka vuina hi ka theihnghilh ang a, Ka lungngaihna hlîpin ka intihlim teh ang, ka tih pawhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka tuarna zawng zawng avâng hian ka thla a phâng a ni, Nangnin mi sualah mi ngai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi suala chhiar ka nih ahnu, Engah nge ṭûl lovah ka intihhah ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sahbawnin inbual fai mah ila, Ka kutte chingalin sil fai mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nangnin bawlhhlawh khurah min paih ang a, Ka silhfênte pawhin mi ten dâwn si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rorêlna hmaah han khing rual em ka nih? Ani zawng, kei anga mihring mai a ni ve si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kan pahniha chunga thu rawn neia, Kan inkâr thu pawtchat thei tu mah an awm si lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Min vuakna tiang chu la sawn sela, A ṭihbaiawmna chuan mi tihlau tawh suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, amah hlau lovin thu ka sawi ang a, Mahse, chutiang chuan ka awm thei si lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nun hi ka ning tawh a, ka phun ka phun mai dâwn a nih hi, Rilru na tak chungin thu ka sawi dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian hnênah, “Mi dem mai lo la, Engti-ah nge min puh, min hrilh teh,” ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I kut chhuakte hmusita tiduhdahin, Mi suaksualte remruat i lâwmpui hi Ṭha i ti em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihring mit ang maiin, Mihring angin i hmu ve em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihring anga damchhûng ni leh kumte Nei ang ziazânga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khawlohna i chhui chiama, Ka sualnate i zawn tehchiam le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi sual ka ni lo tih i hria a, I kut ata mi chhan thei tu mah an awm loh pawh i hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I kutin min din a, nangma siam ngei ka ni, Nangmah bawkin min tiboral leh dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangin hlumin min siam tih hre reng la, Vaivutah mi chantîr leh mai dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangin hnutetui angin mi bun a, Hnute khal angin mi hlâwm a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vun leh tisain mi tuam a, Ruh leh thain mi phuar khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nunna mi pe a, mi duat êm êm a, Min enkawl a, min hualhim zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuti chung chuan hêng thil hi I lo tum ru rêng a ni tih ka hre chhuak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil sual ti ila, nangin i chhinchhiah ang a, Ka khawlohna avângin mi zuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi suaksual ni ila ka chan a va chau dâwn êm! Mi dik pawh ni ila, ka inchhuang thei chuang lo, Mualpho takin ka awm a, ka tuar tlawk tlawk a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lo chapo ila, nangin sakeibaknei an pêl angin mi pêl ang a, Min tina tûrin thil mak tak tak i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Min bei min bei a, ka chungah i thinur i tipung a, Min beih dân tûr kawng thar i dap zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eng vângin nge chhûl ata mi lâk chhuah? Tu ma hmuh lohvin lo thi daih ila a ṭha tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lo piang lo law law ila, chhûl aṭangin Thlân pan nghâl ila a ṭha zâwk tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka damchhûng nite hi a ral ṭêp lo vem ni? Min kiansan hrâm teh, rei lo tê tal ka han hahchâwl hlek teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kîr tawh lohna ram thim, Thim chhah mup rama ka kal hma hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thim chhah mup ram, lungngaihna zân thim, Manganna hmun chu, êng pawh thima a channa hmunah chuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zofara, Naama mi chuan heti hian a han sawi ve a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hetiang thu zozai chhân loh theih em ni? Ṭawng tam avângin miin thiam a chang ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ṭawng tam avângin miin an ngawihsan chein Mi dang thamlo taka i ṭawng hian Timualpho tûr che an awm lo vang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I ṭanna hi dik berah i ngai a, Pathian hmuhah, ‘Ka thianghlim e’ i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, Pathian chu han ṭawng sela, I chungthu han sawi ve se ka va ti êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, finna thurûk a hriattîr ang che a, Finna dik, mihring hriat phâk rual loh chu. Hre ta che, i khawlohnain a phu aia nêpin a hrem che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian ropuizia i hre chhuak zo vem ni? Engkimtitheia chu i hre theia maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vân aia sâng a ni, i hriat phâk rual em ni? Leilâwt aia thûk a ni, i hmuh phâk rual em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A zauzia chu khawmual leh tuifinriat aiin A zau zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian chu lo kalin man che sela, I chungthu rêl ta mai se, tu nge dâl thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tute hi nge mi sualte chu a hria, An sualna a hmu vek a, a ngaihtuah dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram sabengtungno sâwi hmin mai theih a ni lo ang hian, Mi mâwl pawh a fing mai thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I rilru put dân a dika, A lama i kut i phar chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I kuta khawlohna awm a nih chuan paih bo la, I ina sualna a awm i phal loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaihngam takin i lêng vêl thei ang a, I dinhmun a nghet ang a, hlauh tûr i nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hrehawmna i theihnghilh ang a, Tui luang angin i hre zui tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I nun chu chhûn êng aiin a êng ang a, A thim lai pawh zîng êng aiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Beiseiawm a awm avângin i thla a muang ang a, I hawi vêl ang a, ngaihngam takin i châwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I muzâl ang a, tu man an tibuai ngam lo vang che, Mi tam tak biaktlawn i hlawh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi sualte erawh chu an hawihai ang a, Tlân chhuahna kawng rêng an hmu lo vang. An nghah ber chu thih a ni mai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan heti hian a sawi leh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni e, mi fing zawng in lo nih hi, Thi ta hlauh ula, mi fing an awm dâwn tawh hlei nêm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, nangni angin hriatna ka nei ve a, In aiin ka nêp hlei nêm, Tu nge hêng thilte hi hre lo bîk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ka au va, min chhâng ṭhîn a, Mahse, ka ṭhianten min nuihzat a, Mi dik leh demawm lo hi nuihzatbûr ka nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi nuamsate chuan mi vânduai an hmusit a, Rahbi tleute an chhuih zui ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suamhmangte bûk a hnianghnâr a, Pathian tithinurtute an nuamsa. Mahni chakna pathiana neihtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram sate zâwt teh, an zirtîr ang che, Chunglêng savate pawh zâwt la, an hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung pawh bia la, a zirtîr ang che, Tuipui sanghate pawhin hei hi an hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng zawng zawng zîngah hei hi Lalpa tih a nih hre lo tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil nung tinrêng nunna leh mihringte thlarau hi A kuta awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kâ hian thil tui a hria angin Beng hian thu chhia leh ṭha a chian ṭhîn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Upate an fing nge nge a, Dam reiten thil hriat an ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian erawh chu a fingin a chak a, Remruat a thiam a, engkim a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ṭhiat tawh chu tundin leh theih a ni lo. Mihring a khâr hnan chu tu man an chhuah thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ruah sûr a khap chuan khua a khêng a, A sûrtîr leh ram a chîm chhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chu a chak a, a chhan ṭhîn a, Bumtu pawh, bum tuar pawh, a kuta awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Remruattute remhriatna a la bo va, Rorêltute mi â angin a awmtîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalte thuneihna a chhuhsak a, An kâwngah hruiin a hlîng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Puithiamte saruakin a kaltîr a, Mi hlunte a paihthla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi râwnte chu a hnâwl a, Upate finna a chhuhsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi liante a hmusit a, Mi chakte a titlâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thima thil thûkte a hailang a, Thim chhah mup pawh a tiêng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hnamte a tilian a, a tichhe leh a, Hnamte a tipung a, a tidarh leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ram hruaitute ngaihtuahna a tibo va, Thlalêr kawng awm lohnaah a vahvaihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thimthamah an dap dun dun a, Zu rui angin an pai an pai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu ni tin ka hmu a, Bengin ka hria a, ka hrethiam ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In hriat chu ka hre ve bawk a, In aiin ka neu bîk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mahse, El Sadaia hnênah ngei sawi ka duh, Ka chungchâng hi Pathian nên sawi dun ka châk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangni hi dâwta insawimawi ṭhîn, Tidam thei lo daktor ang hi in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngawi hmiah ula, In tân a finthlâk zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ṭanna hi hre chiang ula, Ka thu hi ngaihtuah chiang ve teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian hminga dâwt sawiin Thu dik lo in sawitîr dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amah ṭanin hleih in nei ang maw? Pathian tân in pâwng ṭan dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmu chiang che u sela, In tân a ṭha ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A rûka duhsak bîk in neih chuan A hrem ngei ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ropuina chu râpthlâk in ti êm êm ang a, A ṭihbaiawmna chuan a fan lo vang che u maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In upate thufing chu meivâp ang lek a ni a, In ṭan chhante pawh hlumbêl ang lek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lo ngawi ula, ṭawng hun mi kian teh u, A nih nih ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eng vângin maw? Ka awm awmin ka awm mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tihlum dâwn mah se, ani chu ka ring tho vang. A hmaah ka awm dân ka ṭan zêl dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian hmaah mi sual an lang ngam si lo va, Kei zawng, ka ngampatna avâng hian ka him hlauh mai thei asin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thute hi ngun takin ngaithla ula, Ka thu sawite hi ngaihtuah ngun rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai teh, thiamthu sawi tûrin ka inpeih tawh reng a ni, Thiam ka chang dâwn tih ka hre si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu nge ka sualna rawn phawrh thei awm? Phawrh a nih chuan ngawi rengin ka thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil pahnih chauh mi tihsak la, I hmêl êngah chuan ka hmai ka thup dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka chunga i kutthlâk hi bâng la, I ṭihbaiawmna hian mi thlah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi ko la; tichuan, ka chhâng ang che. A nih loh leh, kei ṭawng ila, Nangin mi chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka khawlohna leh ka sualna eng zâta tam nge? Ka bawhchhiatna leh ka sualnate mi hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Engtizia nge mi hawisana, I hmêlma anga mi ngaih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hnahthel thlâwk i chhaihin, Buhsi lêng i ûm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka chungchâng ṭha lo tak takin i ziak a, Ka tleirâwl ât lai sual mawh mi phurhtîr hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka ke-ah kawl mi buntîr a, Ka awm dân tinrêng i enthla a, Ka hniak lam pawh i chhinchhiah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thil ṭawih ral mai tûr leh Silhfên thîm ei ang lek ka ni chung hian.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmeichhe hrin mihring hi Sual rêng rênga thi thuai mai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pangpâr angin a lo pâr chhuak a, a vuai leh ṭhîn, Hlimthla angin a ral mai a, a awm hlen lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutiang mi chu ngaihmawha Rorêlnaah khing tûr chea hruai tham em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu nge bawlhhlawh aṭangin thil thianghlim la chhuak ngai? Tu mahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A dam chhûng nite chu i ruatsak a, A thlahte lamin i kuta awm an ni. A pelh theih loh ramri i khamsak bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hawisan la, hahchâw teh se, Hlawhfa angin a damchhûng nite a tlingtlâk theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thing chuan beisei tûr a la nei, Kit mah se a lo chawr leh a, Zîk thar chhuah a bâng chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zung lo tar mah se, A bul lei seh chinah thi mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lei hnâwn avângin a lo chawr leh ang a, Thingphun angin a lo buk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, mihring chu a thi a, A ni, a thaw a tâwp a, khawiah nge a awm tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipui kang, tui awm ta lo leh Luipui kang chat, ro châr ta ang hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihring chu a mu a, a tho leh lo. Vân a boral hma chuan a harh lo vang, A muhîl chu kaihthawh a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, Seol-ah mi thukru la ka va ti êm! I thinur reh hma chu mi thukru la, Amaherawhchu, min hriat chhuah leh hun nei ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi a thih hian a nung leh dâwn em ni? Ka chhuah hun a thlen hma hian Rawng ka bâwl fan fan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Min ko la, ka chhâng ang che, I kut chhuakte i ngaina hle si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, ka pên i vêng ang a, Ka sual i chhui zui duh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka bawhchhiatna i phûm bo va, Ka sualte i ngaidam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlângte a min a, Lungpuite a minpui a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Luite chuan lungte chu a hrual a, Tui lian chuan lei a hrût hêk ṭhîn; Chutiangin mihringte beisei i tibo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chu kumkhua atân i titlâwm a, I hnawt bo ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A fate chawimawi an nih pawhin a hre lo va, Chhiat an tawh lahin a ngaihsak tawh hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama taksa na chauh kha a hria a, Amah a inkhawngaih ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Elifaza, Teman mi chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi fing an ṭawng ve mai mai ngai em ni? Thu lawilo mai maiin an khat hlei nêm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mumal nei lovin an ṭawng ang em ni? Thil sâwt lo tûr an sawi peih dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni, Pathian ṭihna rêng i nei lo va, A hnênah i inhlân duh hlei nêm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I sualzia i thu sawiah a lang a, Thuveivîr i thlang a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ni lovin, i ṭawngka ngeiin a thiam lo che a, I hmui ngeiin a hêk che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Piang hmasa ber em i nih? Tlâng awm hmain i awm tawh a maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian remruat i hre pha em ni? Finna hi i ta bîk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan hriat loh eng nge i hriat? Kan hmuh loh eng nge i hmuh bîk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan zîngah luṭuak vâr tawh leh tar te, I pa aia upate pawh an awm asin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathianin a thlamuan che leh Dimdawi taka a enkawlna che hi i ngainêp em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engah nge i thin a thawh thuta, I men rum tâk hle le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I nunin Pathian i dodâl a, I kâin i sawichhia a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihring hi a thianghlim tâwk thei em ni? Hmeichhe hrin hi Pathian hmaah a ṭha tâwk thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian chuan a mi thianghlimte pawh a ring zo lo va, A mit hmuhah vânte pawh a thianghlim tâwk lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihring, sual leh bawlhhlawha khat, Tui in anga sual intu chu a va ring dâwn lo êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi ngaithla la, ka hrilh ang che, Ka hmuh chu ka sawi dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi fingten an pi pute hnêna an dawn, Zêp nei lova min hrilh chhâwn chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ram dang mite awm ve lovin Chu ramah chuan, mahni chauhvin an awm tûr a ni, tih thu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi sual chuan a damchhûng zawng hrehawm a tuar ang, Mi nunrâwng chuan a tuar kumkhua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hlauhawm thâwm chu a hria a, Mahse, hima a inhriat laiin Suamhmangin a rawn bei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thim ata chhuah a inring lo, Khandaihin a hmuak reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ei tûr zawngin a vâk vêl a, ‘Khawiah nge?” tiin; A tân khua a vâr lo tih a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hrehawm leh lungngaihna chuan a rawn bawh a, Lalin a râl do a bei ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian dova kut a lek avângin, El Sadaia a pawisak loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Luhlul takin Pathian chu a dodâl a, A phaw chhah tak leh khauh tak chu a chhuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hmai a mawm a, a dulah thau a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahse, khawpui ṭiau hnuahte a chêng ang a, Tu ma luah loh inahte chuan. Chûngte pawh chu tlusawp leh tho tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A hausa lo vang a, a sum leh pai a awm hlen lo vang, Zâr zo tum a nei tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thim ata a chhuak lo vang a, A zârte chu a kâng ro vang a, A pârte chu thliin a lên bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mahni inbumin, engmahlovah innghat suh se, Eng mah a hmu dâwn chuang si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A hun lovah a ro vang a, A ṭangte pawh a chawr leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Grep rah hlamtla ang a ni ang a, Oliv pâr ṭil ang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak lo mite chu an zuihral ang a, Thamna hmanga in an sakte pawh a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pawi khawih tûr an dap a, thil an tisual nge nge a, An thinlung chu bumnaa khat a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joba chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutiangte chu ka hre ve vek alâwm, In vai hian mi thlamuan thiam lo tak in ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thu puarpawlêng mai mai i sawi i sawi dâwn em ni? Engin nge tiphûr che, i ṭawng i ṭawng le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka chan ang hi chang ve ula, In sawi ang hi ka sawi ve ṭeuh thei ang. Lu ka thinkhum ang che u a, Ka ânkhum zêk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, ka tithatho zâwk ang che u a, Ka ṭawng thlamuan bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sawi sawi mah ila ka na a dam chuang lo, Ka ngawih reng pawhin a nêp chuang bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nangin min nghaisa a, Kan chhûngin min timang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka vun zûr hian mi sawisak dân a tilang a, Ka chêrzia hian ka natzia a tilang bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangin thinurin min pawtthlêr a, min hua a, Hachang mi ṭhial khum a, Mi dotuten rum takin min melh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miten min chhiatkhum a, Diriam takin biangah min bêng a, Mi bei tûrin an inhâwr khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amah ngaihsak lote hnênah Pathianin min hlân a, Mi sualte kutah min pe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlamuang taka ka awm der der lai Min rawn ṭhuai nawk nawk a, Ka ringah min rêk a, mi nawr nek a. A chhia zawng zawng min bûrbun ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thal kâptuten mi hual tlat a, Dîm lêk lovin ka kalah min kâp a, Ka mît chu leiah an leihbaw ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mi nghaisa mi nghaisa a, Râwng takin min chîl nek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saiip puan ka sîn a, Mualpho takin vaivutah ka ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ṭahna lamah ka meng sen rûm a. Ka mitte pawh a vûng bûr mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, ka kutte hian thil sual a khawih lo va, Tihtakzetin ka ṭawngṭai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw leilung, ka thisen an chhuah hi ngawihpui mai suh la, Ka mangang au thâwm hi tâwp mai suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tûnah ka thuhretu vânah a awm a, Min sawisaktu chu chung lama mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ṭhianten min nuihsan mah se, Mittui nên Pathian lam ka hawi zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miin a ṭhian tân a ngaihsak ang hian, Pathian hnêna min sawisaktu awm teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka kumte chu a ral ṭêp a, Kîr tawh lohna kawng chu ka zawh mai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thaw hleithei ta lo, ka dam rei tawh lo vang, Thlân lo chu hmabâk ka nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni, hmusittuten mi hual vêl a, Min diriamna chu ka hmu reng mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmah ngei ka lamah ṭang teh, Nang lo chu belh tûr ka neih loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangin an thinlung i tidel a, An inchhuan phal suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlâwkna ûma ṭhiante fakdertu chu A fapa mit tideltu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miten kamchhe tleuh nân min hmang a, Ka hmaiah chil min chhâk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungngaih avângin ka mit a thim zo va, Ka kutke pawh ruhkawl mai a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi nun ngîlte chuan hei hi mak an ti a, Pawi khawih lote pawhin mi sualte chu an dem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi ṭha chuan a awm dân chu a thlah lo vang, Kut faite chu an nghet tial tial bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In vaiin lo hawiin lo kal mah ula, In zîngah mi fing rêng ka hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hun a ral dâwn ta, ka thil tumte a hlawhchham a, Ka duhsâm a thlâwn ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zân chu chhûn an vuah a, Thim chu êng hmahruaitu an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Seol chu ka hmabâk a ni ta, Thima ka mutna hmun tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thlân chu, ‘Ka pa’ ka ti ang a, Ka taksa lungte chu, ‘Ka nu, ka farnu’ ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu mai lo chu beisei tûr dang eng nge ka neih? Beisei tûr dang a awm em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mitthi khuaa ka chhuk hun chuan, Beiseina nên vaivutah chuan kan chêng dûn ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Bildada, Sua mi chuan heti hian a sawi ve a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng chen nge sawi tûr i dap i dap dâwn? Ngaithla ve la, ka han sawi ve ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eng vângin nge ramsa ang leka min ngaiha, Mi mâwl tê tê ang chauhva min hmuh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I thinur avângin mahni i intihrehawm a, Nangmah avângin lei hi hnuchhawn a ni ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni, mi sual êng chu a chuai a, A meidê pawh a mit zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A puan ina êng chu a thim ang a, A meichher pawh a thi bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngal tha chak chu a dul zo va, Ama remruat chu a chhiat phah ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lên chhûngah a pên lût a, Thangah chuan a âwk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thang chuan a kerêkah a âwk ang a, A hrui chuan a hlîng tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tlâk nân hum an lai a, A awh nân thang an kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kil tin aṭangin hlauhawmin a ûm a, A kalna apiangah a zui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rilṭâmin a chau ta a, Chhiatna chuan a hual tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Natna hlauhawm takin a bâwm a, A kutke chu a ṭawih zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A himna puan in aṭangin an hnûk chhuak a, Hlauhawm Lal hnênah an hruai lût.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A puan inah mi dang an chêng ang a, A then fai nân kât an theh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A zungte chu a mawih ang a, A zârte pawh a ro zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leiah tu man an hre reng tawh lo vang a, Kawtthlêrah a hming rêng a lang tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu êng aṭangin thimah an paih lût a, Khawvêl ata an paih chhuak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A mite zîngah tu leh fa a nei lo vang a, A chênna in rochungtu pawh a nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A chan chu khawthlang lam mite chuan râpthlâk an ti a, Khawchhak lam mite pawhin hlauhawm an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ni, chu chu mi sualte chan tûr chu a ni, Chu ngei chu Pathian hre lote awm dân tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joba chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng chen nge na taka min ṭawng khum anga, Min tihhrehawm dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vawi sâwm ngawt min hau ta a, Zah nachâng hre lêk lovin min ânkhum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lo dik lo ngei a nih chuan Ka sual man chu ka têl ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei aia ṭha zâwka in inruata, Ka sual vânga mualpho nia min ngaih tlat chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hre ta che u, Pathian chuan mi hnâwl a, A lênin min khuh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Min sawisa,” tia ka au pawhin tu man min chhâng si lo va, Ka au chiam pawhin ngaihsaktu rêng ka nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kawng mi pinsak avângin ka kal tlang thei lo, Ka kawngte chu a tithim zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ropuina mi hlihsak a, Ka lallukhum mi lâksak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kil tinah min tichhia a, eng mah ka ni ta lo, Thing angin ka beiseina a phawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka chungah a thinur êm êm a, A hmêlmate zîngah min chhiar ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sipai rual an lo kal a, Ṭan hmun an rawn khuar a, Ka puan in vêlah bûk an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka unaute min tihhlatsak a, Ka ṭhiante pawh mi hrang an chang zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka laichînten min kal bosan a, Ka ṭhian bulten min theihnghilh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mikhualte leh ka chhiahhlawh nulaten Mikhualah min ngai a, An hmêlhriat loh, ram dang miah min ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh pawh ka au ei zo ta lo, Ṭawngkam thlum thawh a ngai ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka nupuiin ka kâ rimchhia a ti a, Ka unau pianpuite tân tenawm mai ka lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupangchhia lamin min hmusit a, Ka han tho te hi min lo eu va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ṭhian ṭha zawng zawngten min ten a, Ka hmangaih berte pawhin min hawisan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ruhkawl leh vun mai ka ni ta, Ka nung chang chang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi khawngaih rawh u, ka ṭhiante u, mi khawngaih rawh u, Pathianin min khawih ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian ang ziazângin nangnin engati nge min tihduhdah ve le? Ka tuarna hi tâwk in la ti na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw, ka thute hi ziak ni sela, Lehkhabu-ah chuang ve teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ziakna thîrkhen leh suanin Kumkhua atân lungpuiah ker ni teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi tlantu chu a nung tih ka hria, Nakinah chuan vaivutah hian a lo ding ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka vunte hi a chhiat hnuin Ka tisain Pathian ka la hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kei ngei hian ka la hmu ang a, Ka mit ngei hian amah tak chu a la hmu ang. Ka thinlung a chau ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Engtin nge amah chu kan tihduhdah ang, Buaina bul chu amah hi a ni,” in tih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khandaih chu hlau rawh u, Khandaiha hremna hi Pathian thinur lanna a ni, Tichuan, rorêltu a awm tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Zofara, Naama mi chuan a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngun taka ka ngaihtuahin chhân ka châk a, Chhân hlân pawh ka nghâkhlel a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Min zilh dân chuan min va tai ve, Chhân dân tûr che ka hre reng asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmasâng leia mihring awm chin ata tûn thlengin He thu hi i hre ngai lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sual chu rei a hlim lo va, Pathian hre lo mi lâwmna chu mitkhapkâr chauh a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A inngaih ropuina chuan vân tawng mah se, A lu pawh chuan chhûm thleng mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama êk angin a ral vang vang ang, Amah hmu ṭhînte chuan “Khawiah nge a awm tâk?” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mumang angin a ral ang a, an hmu leh tawh lo vang, Zân inlârna angin a bo thuai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mit ngeia hmu ṭhînte khân an hmu leh tawh lo vang a, A awmna ṭhîn hmunah an hmu leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Retheite a rûksak a, A faten chûng mite chu tihlâwm an tum ang a, A sum lâk chu an pe kîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A tleirâwl thazatna nên Vaivutah an la chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sual hi a kâin tui ti hlein A lei hnuaiah thukru tlat mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lem phal lovin hmuam tlat mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thil ei chuan a pum a tilumlet ang a, A kawchhûngah rûl tûr a chang ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hausakna a dawlhte chu a luak chhuak a, Pathianin a pum aṭangin a luak chhuahtîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rûl tûr a fâwp a, Tûr chuan ani chu a tihlum ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lui tui luang chu a hmu ve tawh lo vang. khawizu leh hnutetuia luang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thawhrim rah chu ei lovin a chân ang a, A khâwl khâwm pawh a chên chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Retheite a tiduhdah a, a hnuchhawn a, Mahni in sa lovin mi sak sa a chhuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A duhâmna chuan chin lêm a nei lo ve, Mahse, a ro chuan a chhan thei dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ei lohva hleih a nei lo va, A sum leh pai chuan a daih lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hausak vânglai takin a tlachhe thut ang a, Vânduaina chuan a hual vêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In ei thau hle mah se, Pathian thinurna nasa tak chu a chungah a tla ang, A kawchhûnga khat khawpin a sûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thîr-fei hlauvin tlânchhe mah se, Dâr thal chuan a chhun tlang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A phawi a, a hnung lamah a chhuak a, A hmâwr tlê-ah thisen a kai, Hliampui a tuar ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thim nasa takin a hmuak ang a, A rote chu mihring chhêm ni lo meiin a kâng ang a, A puan ina la awmte pawh a kâng ral vek bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vânte chuan a khawlohna a puang ang a, Lei pawhin thiam loh a chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tui lianin a in a lên bo vang a, Pathian thinur ni-ah a neih zawng zawng a ral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chûng chu mi sual chan tûr Pathian ruatsak chu a ni, An ro chan tûra Pathian ruat chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan, a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thu sawi ngun takin ngaithla ula, Chu chu min thlamuanna ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Min ngaithla ula, ka han sawi ang e, Ka sawi zawhah in duh leh min nuih dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihring chungah em phunnawi ka nih? Han dawhthei rual ka ni lo asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Min en ula, mak in ti hle ang, In kâ in hup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka chunga thil thleng hi ka ngaihtuahin ka mangang a, Hlauhnain ka thauvah a man ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Engtizia nge mi sualte an nun renga, Tarkûna damin an hmuingîl hle le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An tu leh fate hlawhtling takin an dampui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An in leh lo hlauhawm lakah a him a, Pathian lahin a hrem hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An bâwngpate chî a ṭha a, An bâwngpuiten no an chhiat ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ran rual angin an fate an chhuahtîr dem dem a, Hlim takin an tualchai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dârbenchhek leh ṭingṭang remin an zai a, An phênglâwng nên hlim takin an ri bûng bûng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An damchhûngin nuam takin an khawsa a, Thlamuang takin mual an liam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian hnênah, “Mi kalsan rawh, I kawngte hriat kan duh lo ve,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chu tu nge maw a niha, A rawng kan bâwlna tûr chu? A hnêna kan ṭawngṭaiin hlâwkna eng nge kan hmuh ang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An sum leh pai chu an thawh chhuah a ni lo va, Mi sualte remruatnaah chuan ka tel ve lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi sual khâwnvâr chu a mit fo va, Vânduaina an chungah a thleng fo bawk a, Pathian thinurna chuan chhiatna a thlentîr a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thli chhêm lên buhpâwl ang an ni a, Thlipuiin buhsi a len bo ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A sualna avângin a fate a hrem in ti a, Amah ngei chuan tuar ang hmiang, a inhriat chhuah theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A mit ngeiin a chunga chhiatna lo thleng chu hmu sela, Engkimtitheia thinurna chu tuar rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A damchhûng nite a liam tawh hnuah chuan, A kalsan tâk a chhûngte a ngaihtuah ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chung lam vâna thil awmte chunga rorêltu Pathian chu Tu nge hriatna zirtîr thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat chu hlim tak leh nuam takin an khawsa a, an thau mûm tûl a, an mawm hmuk mai a, An thi an vânglaiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat erawh chu thil ṭha chên lovin Hrehawm takin an awm a, An thi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vaivutah an mu tlâng a, A lungin a bâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I ngaihtuahte ka hria asin, Mi diriamzia pawh ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Khawiah nge mi ropui in chu a awm tâk? Mi sualte chênna puan in pawh khawiah nge,” in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zin vêl mite in zâwt ngai lo vem ni? An sawite chu in awih na nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi sual chu vânduai ni atân khêk a ni a, Thinur ni-ah hruai chhuah a ni,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tu nge a hmaichhanah a sualna chachhuah anga, A thil lo tih tu nge thungrûl ngam ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thlânah phûm a ni a, Ngun takin an vêng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ruama lei chuan ṭha takin a khuh a, A hmaah mi tam tak an kal tawh angin Mi tam takin a hnung an zui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Engtin tehlulin nge nangnin dâwtin min thlamuan theih ang? In sawite chu engmahlo mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Elifaza, Teman mi chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihring hian Pathian tân ṭangkaina a nei em? Mi fing ber pawh a hlâwkpui dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dikna chu Engkimtitheian a ṭangkaipui em? Sawisêlbova i nun avângin hlâwkna eng nge a neih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian i ṭih avânga hrem i ni lo va, Rorêlnaa hruai i ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I sualna a nasat êm avâng a ni, I sualnain tâwpintai a nei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng mah tham lovah i unaute lakah dahkham i phût a, An silhfên hlihsakin saruakin i awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chaute chu in tûr tui i pe lo va, Rilṭâmte tân chaw i ui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I thiltihtheihnain mi ram i lâksak a, I duhsakzâwngte i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmeithaite chu kutruakin i kal botîr a, Fahrahte pawh i rapbet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvâng alâwm i vêlin thangin a hual che a, Chhiatna nasa tak leh hlauhawmin a hual che ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khua a thim a, i hmu thei lo va, Tui lian chuan a khuh ta che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pathian chu vânsângahte hian a awm lo vem ni? Arsite khi sâng hle mah se, a rawn chhuk en a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eng nge Pathianin a rawn hriat ang le? Chhûmin a hliah tlat a, engtin nge min rêlsak theih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Min hmuh theih loh nân chhûm chhah takin a khuh a, Vânlaizâwlah a lêng vêl a,” i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi sualten an zawh ṭhin kawng hlun chu I zawh ve dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hun lovah sawn bo an ni a, An innghahna pawh tui lianin a lên bo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian hnênah, “Min kalsan rawh, Engkimtitheia chuan eng nge min tih theih?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuti chungin an inte thil ṭhain a tihkhahsak a, Chuvângin, mi sualte remruat chu ka hrethiam thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi dikte chuan an hmuhin an lâwm a, Pawi khawih lote pawhin an nuihsan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Kan hmêlmate chu tihchhiat an ni ta, Mei chuan an hausakna a kâng ral ta,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian hnênah inhlân la, amah nên inrem rawh, Tichuan, i hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kamchhuak zirtîrna chu pawm la, I thinlungah vawng tlat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkimtitheia hmaa inngaitlâwma i kîra, I in ata thil sual i dah bo daih chuan A tungding ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I rangkachak chu vaivut ang leka i ngaiha, I rangkachak ṭha chi pawh, Luikawr lungte ang maia i ngaih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chu i rangkachak leh tangkaraw tlang, I tâna hlu tak chu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ni, Engkimtitheia chu i ring tlat ang a, Amah chu i lâwmna ber a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hnênah i ṭawngṭai ang a, anin a ngaithla ang che, Tichuan, i thutiamte lâwm takin i hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I thil ruahman chu a hlawhtling ang a, I kawngte pawh a tiêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin mi chapote a hnûkhniam a, Inngaitlâwmte a chhanhim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi pawi khawih lo chu a chhan chhuak ang a, I kut a thianghlim chuan Nang pawh a chhan chhuak bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka manganna vawiin thlengin ni tin a zual zêl a, Ka rûm hian ka natzia pawh a hril zo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, amah ka hmuh theihna tûr lam chu hria ila, A thut hmunah chuan ka kal tûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka chungthu a hnênah chuan ka thlen ang a, Ka tanfung zawng zawng hi ka sawi chhuak vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi chhân dân ka hre duh a, A sawi tûr chu hriat ka châk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thiltihtheihna nasa tak nên min bei dâwn em ni? Dâwn lo, ka lamah beng a chhi zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei mi nun ngîl hian a hmaah thu ka thlen ang a, Thiam changin ka chhuak hlen tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khawchhak lamah ka kal a, ani chu a awm si lo, Khawthlang lam ka zawn leh ka hmu si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmâr lama a chêt laiin ka hmu lo va, Chhim lam a pan pawhin ka hmu thei chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka kawng zawh chu a hria. Mi fiah hnuah rangkachak angin ka chhuak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kete hian a hniakhnung a zui zêl a, Pêngbo lovin a kawng ka zawh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kam chhuak thupêk chu ka pênsan lo va, A thu chhuakte chu chaw aiin ka ngaihlu zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi rilru nghet a ni, tu nge khawih her thei ang? A duhzâwng chu a ti mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka chan tâwka a rêl chu a hlen ang a, Chutiang chu a la nei teuh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvângin, a hmaah hlauvin ka khûr a, Ka ngaihtuah chângin ka hlau zual thîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathianin ka thinlung a tichau va, Thim chhah angin min khuh mah sela, Ka hlau chuang lo, Engkimtitheia chu a ni mi tizâmtu chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chuan engati nge rorêl hun a ruat loh? Engah nge amah hretuten chu ni chu an hmuh loh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat chuan ramri lung an sawn a, Mi ran rual an chhuh chu anmahni ta angin an vulh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fahrahte sabengtung an lâksak a, Dahkham atân hmeithai bâwngpa an hrêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Retheite awm ngaihna hre lovin an siam a, Ram chhûnga tlachhamte chu biru tûrin an tlânchhia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlalêr ram sabengtung angin Ṭhahnemngai takin chaw an zawng ṭâwk ṭâwk a, Thlalêrah chuan an fate tân chaw an hmu hrâm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi lova buh sengin an inhlawh a, Mi sualte pawhin an grep lo tûrin an chhawr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Puan sin lovin saruakin zankhuain an mu a, Khawvâwta intuam lumna eng mah an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlânga ruahpui sûrin a nan huh a, Phen tûr zawngin lungpui an bêl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pa nei lo hnute hne laite chu an pawtthla a, Mi retheite chu an leiba aiah an fate an lâksak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Silhfên an tlachham a, saruakin an vâkvai a, Rilṭâm chungin an buhphalte an pu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Oliv huanah hriak an her a, Uain khurah grep an rap sâwr a, Tuihâl dangchârin hna an thawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawvêla mi tam tak thichhâwnga rûm te, Ṭanpui dîla hliam tuar au te, Pathian lahin a ngaihsak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat chuan êng an hua a, êngah an kal duh lo. Khaw êngah pawh an awm duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Varṭianah tualthattu chu a tho va, Rethei leh chanhaite a that a, Zânah pawh rûkru angin a che vêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Uire chuan khaw thim a thlîr a, “Tu man min hmu tawh lo vang,” tiin. A hmai a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chûng mite chu zânah in rek pawpin an lût ru a, Chhûnah an inkalhkhung a, Êngah an awm duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thim chhah mup chu an tân zîng a ni a, Thim hnuaia hlauhawmte nên an innêl êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tui lian chuan chak takin a lên bo va, A ram chan chu ânchhe dawng a ni a, A grep huana thawk tûrin tu mah an kal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khawkhêng ni saah vûr a tuiral angin Mi sualte pawh thlânah an ṭawih ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nu chuan a theihnghilh tawh ang a, A lung tân chaw tui tak a ni ang. Mi sualte chu hriat reng an ni tawh lo vang a, Thing anga tihtliah an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ching, fa hring thei lote chu rethei takin a chhawr a, Hmeithaite a khawngaih ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathianin a thiltihtheihnain mi chakte a hnawt kiang a, An tho chhuak nain dam rêng an beisei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Him tak leh thlamuang âwm takin a chawlhtîr a, Mahse, an kawng chu a mitin a en reng si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rei lo tê atân chawisân an ni a, An ral leh ṭhîn, tihhniamin an awm a, Mi dangte angin mual an liam a, Buhvui anga ah chhum an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chu chu a dik lo a nih pawhin Tu nge, “I daw’” min ti thei ang? “I thute hi eng mah a ni lo,” tu nge ti thei ang?
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bildada, Sua mi chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian chu a lalin a va zahawm êm, Vân sângte khi muanawm takin a vêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A sipai rualte chu chhiar sên rual an ni lo, A ênga a chhun loh tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engtin nge Pathian hmaah miin thiam a chan theih ang? Engtin nge hmeichhe hrin a thianghlim theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A mit hmuhah chuan thla meuh pawh khi a êng lo va, Arsite pawh an thianghlim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihring lek phei chu thil lung mai a ni, Mihring fapa pawh changpât mai a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi chak lo i han ṭanpui dân leh Bân tha chak lo i han chhân dân chu le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi mâwl i han zilh fing a, Thu ril tak tak i va han sawi tam ve!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tu thlarau nge i chana Tu nge maw i han hrilh vei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mitthi thlaraute chu lei hnuaiah an khûr a, Chuta chêngte nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mitthi khua chu Pathianin a hmu vek a, Chhiatna hmun chuan hliahtu a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmâr lamah vân a pharh a, Engmahlovah lei chu a khai kâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chhûm chhah tak chuan ruahtuite a fûn khâwm a, A tui paite avângin chhûmte chu a ṭet chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lalṭhutthlêng chu chhûmin a khuh a. A vêlin a zîng mup mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thim leh êng inrina atân Tui chungah kâwlkil a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vân dona bante chu a nghîng dur dur a, A zilhhauna chu mak an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thiltihtheihnain tuifinriat a thunun a, Thiam takin Rahab a tan chhum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thawin vân chu a tithiang a, A kutin rûlpui tlânchhia a that.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh, hêng hi a thiltih hmatheh mai a la ni, A chanchin kan hriat hi a va beitham êm, A thiltihtheihna thâwm ri chu tu nge hre zo thei ang?
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joba chuan heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka dikna ngainêpa, ka nun tilungngaitu, Engkimtitheia, Pathian nung chhâlin ka sawi e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka damchhûnga Pathian thaw Ka hnâra a awm chhûng chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hmuiin thu lawilo a sawi lo vang a, Ka leiin dâwt a sawi hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thiam dâwn teuh lo mai che u, Ka thih thlengin ka dik tih ka ṭan tlat dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka dikzia ka ṭan tlat ang a, Ka thu ka zûk lo vang. Ka dam chhûng zawng inthiam lohna ka nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hmêlma chu mi sual angin, Mi dotu chu mi dik lo angin hrem ni teh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ngaihsak lo tân beisei tûr eng nge awm? Pathianin a hnâwla, a nun a lâksak bawk si chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Buainain a chîm laiin Pathianin an au thâwm a ngaithla dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engkimtitheia chungah a lâwm ang em? Pathian chu eng lai pawhin a ko vang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thianghlimzia chu ka zirtîr ang che u, Engkimtitheia remruat chu ka zêp lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmahni ngeiin hêng hi in hmu vek si a, Engtizia nge mumal nei lo taka in ṭawng mai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathianin mi sualte chan tûra a ruat leh, Engkimtitheian hnehchhiahte chan tûra a ruat chu hei hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fa tam tak nei mah se, khandaih tuar tûr mai an ni, A rîla rahten chaw kham khawp an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thlah la dam chhunte pawh hriin an thi ang. An nupuite pawhin sûnna hun an nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vaivut anga tam tangkarua khâwlin, Silhfên pawh hlum angin tiang khâwm mah se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tian khâwm chu mi dikten an la inbel ang a, A tangka pawh pawi khawih loten an la insem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A in sak chu maimawm rîl zam ang lek a ni, Vêngtuin chhâwlbûk a sak ang lek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hausa takin a mu a, a mut hlânin a sum a ral zo va, A han harh chuan eng mah a nei tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui lian angin hlauhawmin a nangchîng ang a, Zâna thlipui lo tlehin a la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khawchhak thliin a lên bo vang a, a awm tawh lo vang, A hmun ata a nuai bo dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zahngai lovin a nuai chiam ang a, A thiltihtheihna hmaah chuan a tlânchhe rawk rawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Miten an kut an ben khum ang a, Chek khumin a hmun aṭangin an ûm chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tangkaraw laihchhuahna hmun a awm a, Rangkachak tihthianghlimna hmun pawh a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thîr chu lei aṭanga lâk chhuah a ni a, Dâr sen chu lung aṭanga rawhtui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miten thimah êng an chhi zêl a, Khur thûk tak takah an lût a, Thim chhah mupa lung awmte chu lai chhuak tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mite chên lohnaah khur an lai a, A chunga kalte pawhin an hre lo. Mi hriatpui lohvah an inkhai a, an inthên vêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lei pâwnlâng hi buh tân a ni a, A chhûngril erawh chu mei kan ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei chhûnga lungah te chuan safir lunghlu a awm a, A dipahte rangkachak a tel bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chumi kalna chu mulukawlh pawhin a hre lo, Mu pawhin a hmu ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ramsa kawlhte pawhin an tlawh lo va, Sakeibakneite pawh an kal ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mite chuan lung changte chu an la a, Tlângte chu a bulṭhutah an hai let a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungpuite pawh an verh tlang a, Thil hlu tak tak an hmu chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luite chu pût hauh lovin an khuap a, Thil lang lote chu an tilang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahse, finna chu khawiah nge an hmuh ang a, Hriatna chu khawiah nge a awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihringin a hlutzia an hre lo va, Mi nung ramah hian an hmu hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuithûkpui chuan, “Ka hnênah a awm lo,” a ti a. Tuifinriat chuan, “Ka hnênah a awm lo,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rangkachaka lei theih a ni lo va, A man atân tangkarua bûk chhuah chi a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ofir rangkachakin a tluk thei lo va, Onix leh safir lunghlute pawhin an tluk thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rangkachak leh lung fîmin a hen lo va, Rangkachak nomawia thleng theih a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Berul leh Krustal lunghlute nên tehkhin rual a ni lo. A ni, finna man chu lunghlu man aiin a tam zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ethiopia ram lunghlu topaz pawhin a khan lo va, Rangkachak thianghlim ai pawhin a hlu zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nih, finna chu khawi aṭanga lo kal nge? Hriatna chu khawiah nge a awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil nung pakhat mahin an hmuh theih loh tûra thup a ni a, Chunglêng savate lakah thuhrûk tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Boralna leh thihna chuan “A thâwm zawng kan bengin kan hria,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian chauhvin a kawng chu a hria a. Amah chauh a ni a awmna hmun pawh hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lei tâwp thlengin a thlîr a, Vân hnuaia thil tinrêng hi a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thli chak dân a teh lai leh Tuite a teh lai khân
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ruahtui tlâk dân tûr a ruahman lai leh, Khawpui ri leh kawlphe kawng a siam lai khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tichuan, finna chu a hmu a, a puangzâr a, A tinghet a, a chhui chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mihring hnênah chuan, “Ngai rawh, Lalpa ṭih hi finna a ni, Thil ṭha lo kalsan hi hriatthiamna chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joba chuan a thu sawi chhunzawmin heti hian a ti a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tûn hma thla ral ta, Pathianin min vênhim laite ang khân awm ka va châk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A khâwnvâr chu ka lu chungah a êng a, A êng ringin thim chu ka kaltlang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka vânglai ni-ah te Pathianin ka puan ina min pâwl laite khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engkimtitheian min châmchilh a, Ka fate ka kianga an awm lai khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kawngahte hnutetui a luan dûl dûl lai leh, Lungpuia hriak kan sâwr tluk tluk laite khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui kawngka pana ka kal chhuaha, Kawtthlêra rorêlna ṭhuthmun ka rem laite khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlangvâlten min hmu a, an bibo va, Upate an tho va, an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hotute ṭawng lai pawh an châwl a, An kutin an kâ an hup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miliante pawh an ngawi ṭhuap a, An lei chu an dangah a bet a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thu sawi hriaten min fak a, Min hmututen min chawimawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi rethei ṭanpui ngai, ṭapte ka chhan chhuak a, Ṭanpuitu nei lo fahrahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thi dâwn ṭêpin an duhsakna min hlân a, Hmeithaite pawh hlim takin ka zaitîr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Diknain ka inthuam a, Rorêlna dik chu ka kawrfual leh lallukhum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mitdel tân mit ka ni a, Kebai tân ke ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlachham tân pa ka ni a, Ka hmêlhriat lohte thubuai pawh ka ngaihtuahsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi sualte ngho chu ka tihtliahsak a, An thil seh chu ka pawh chhuahsak bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A rei thei ang ber dam ka tum a, “Keima in ngeiah ka thi ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka zungte chu hmun hnâwngah a zâm lût ang a, Ka zârah chuan zânkhuain dai a châm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ropui deuh deuh vang a, Ka chak telh telh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miten beisei takin ka lamah beng an dawh a, Ka thurâwn nghâkin an ngawi ṭhuap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka han sawi zawh chuan eng mah an sawi tawh lo, Ka thu sawi chu an ei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ruahtui tla tîr miin an nghâkhlel angin min nghâk a, Ruah hnuhnûng duh angin ka thu an hre duh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An beidawn laiin ka tihlim a, Ka hlim hmêl chuan anni chu a tiharh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An kawng zawh tûr ka thlansak a, An hotu-ah ka ṭhu a. Sipai rual zînga lal angin ka awm a, An tân lusûnte hnêmtu ang ka ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûnah zawng ka aia naupangten min nuihzat a, An pate pawh ka ran rual vêngtu, Ui zînga telah pawh ka duh lohte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chûng thaṭhum tawhte bân tha chu Ka la ṭangkaipui dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tlachham leh rilṭâmin thing zung an khel a, Thim hnuaiah thlalêr hnuchhawn ramah an vâk vêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thlalêr builukham an pawt a, Juniper zungte an chaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi zîng aṭangin hnawh chhuah an ni a, Rûkru angin an au zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruam kumkârahte an awm a, Khuarkhurum leh lungpui phênah te chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnimbuk hnuaiahte mangangin an râk chûl a, Kangṭhai buk hnuaiahte an tawm khâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tlâktlailo leh bengtlalo, Mihringa chhiar tlâk loh an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah zawng hlaah min phuah el a, An kamchhe tleuhna ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Min ten a, ka lakah an inthiarfihlîm a, Ka hmaia chil chhâk tak an nâp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah Pathianin ka chakna min lâksak a, Chuvângin, ka thu engah mah an ngai ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ding lamah mipui an lo thawk a, Ka ke-ah min kalh thlu a, Ka chhiatna tûr an belhchhah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tlân chhuahna tûr an tichhia a, Ka vânduaina an tizual a. Tu man an khap si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kulh bang chim zau laiah an lo lût a, A chimte chuan mi delh bet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil râpthlâk takin mi nangchîng a, Ka zahawmna thli angin a liam a. Ka hamṭhatna pawh chhûm angin a kiang zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah ka thi dâwn ta a nih hi, Tuarna chuan min thlah si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zankhuain ka ruhte a na ngut ngut a, Mi kher ngur ngur hi a châwl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka na hian nghâwnga reh angin min rêk a, Ka tâl ka tâl a, Ka silhfênte pawh ka tâl chuar zo vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathianin chirhdûpah min paih lût a, Vaivut leh vut ang chauh ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang ka ko che a, mi chhâng lo va, Ka din pawhin mi hawi si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lakah i nun a râwng ta a, Dîm lo tawpin min khawih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangin thli mi lentîr a, sâng takah min vawrh a, Thlipuiin mi lên mi lên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangin min tihlum dâwn a, Mi nung zawng zawng tâna hmun ruatah chuan Min hruai dâwn tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chhiat tâwk chungah engah nge kut i thawha, Eng mah ti thei lo, khawngaih dîltu chungah hian?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Buaina tâwkte tân ka ṭap ṭhîn lâwm ni? Tlachhamte ka khawngaih ṭhîn lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thil ṭha ka beisei laiin thil ṭha lo a lo thleng a, Êng ka nghâk a, thim a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka thin a phu hlawp hlawp a, a reh thei si lo, Hrehawm tuarna hun chuan mi rawn nang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ni em vâng ni lovin ka hmêl a thu a, Pungkhâwmho zînga dingin ṭanpui ka dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sihalte unaupa ka ni, Ostrich-te tân ṭhian ṭha ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vunte a lo dum a, a khawk a, Ka taksa pawh a lum vung vung mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka ṭingṭang a ri kuai ruai a, Ka phênglâwng ri pawh ṭah hlaah a chang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nula ngaihmelh lo tûrin thu ka tiam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chung Pathian hnêna mihring chan tûr leh Sadaia, vân sânga awm hnêna rochan tûr eng ang nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi sualte tân chhiatna leh Thil sual titute tân vânduaina a ni dâwn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kawngte a hmu vekin Ka kepênte a chhiar lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dâwt sawi ka chîna, Mi bum tuma hmanhlel ṭhîn ka nih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bûkna dik takin min teh sela, Ka dikzia hi Pathian chuan a hre mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, kawng dik aṭanga ka pêna, Ka mitin suala min hruaia, Ka kutin thil sual a khawih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thawh rah chu mi dangin ei sela, Ka thlai chînte chu pawt vek rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ṭhenawmpa nupui ka îta. A kawngka bula ka chân rûk chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nupui chuan mi dang chaw chhûm sela, Mi dangin mutpui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu chu bawhchhiatna sual lian tak, Rorêltuten an hrem ngei tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutiang sual chu, kâng ral vek thei mei a ni a, Ka sum zawng zawng pawh a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawhnu leh chhiahlawhpate chu Ka laka an vuivaina thu Dik taka ka ngaihtuahsak duh loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian a lo thawh hunah engtin nge ka tih tâk ang? A rawn zawh fiah hunah, engtin nge ka chhân tâk ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pum chhûnga mi siamtu khân anni pawh a siam lo vem ni? Mi pakhat kutchhuak kan ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlachhamte mamawh hrênsakin Hmeithaite ka tibeidawng ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka chaw keimah maia ei lovin Fahrahte ka eitîr ve ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anni chu an tleirâwl lai ata pa angin ka enkawl a, An sên têt ata ka kaihruai zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tu pawh silhfên nei lova vâkvai emaw, Hâk tûr nei lo rethei ka hmuh chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka berâm hmul ngeia siamin ka tuam lum ang a, Tichuan, anin min fak takzet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rorêlnaah ṭantu ka neih dâwn avânga, Fahrahte chunga kut ka thlâk chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka koki hi ka dâr saiphêng nên phawk hlawk sela, Ka bân hi a bulah tliak hmawk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian hrem ka hlauh êm avâng leh A ropui êm si avângin chûng thilte chu ka ti ngam lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rangkachak chu rinchhan bera ka hmana, Rangkachak thianghlim hnênah, “Ka himna i ni,” ka tih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hausak êm avâng leh hna thawh tam avânga lâwm ka nih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni khi a ên êm avâng leh Thla pawh a ropui êm avânga ngaisânga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A rûka ka rilru an lo hîp beha, Anmahni zaha ka kut ka phar chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu pawh chu rorêltu hrem ngei chi, sual a ni, Chung Pathian phatsantu ka nih dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi hawtu chhiatnaa lâwm ka nih emaw, Thil ṭha lovin a tlâkbuak laia ka hlim viau emaw chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Thi se,” tia ânchhe lawh nân Ka kâ ka phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“I chaw ei lo tu nge awm le?” Ka awmpuiten an tih loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mikhualte kawtthlêrah an riak ngai lo, Khualzinte tân ka kawng ka hawng reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mi anga sualna zêp chîng ka ni lo, Sualna ka pai ru ve ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mipui zah avâng leh chipuite hau hlauh vânga Ngawi renga awma lêng chhuak ngam lovin ka awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka thu ngaithlatu tûr an awm na nge aw, Ka sawi apiang a dik asin. Engkimtitheian mi chhâng teh se, Ka chhiar atân min hêkna hi ziak chhuah ni se ka va ti êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chhuang takin ka kokiah ka târ ang a, Lallukhum angin ka khum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka tih apiang Pathian ka hrilh ang a, Ngampa takin amah ka pan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka lo neih lai hi ka rûk a niha, A neitu dik tak chhuhsak ka nih chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Man pe lova a rah chauh ei ka lo niha, A thlotute dangchâra ka siam chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Huit aiah hlîng ṭo zâwk sela, Barli aiah hlohar ṭo zâwk rawh se. Joba thu chu a tâwp ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chu ṭha a intih êm avângin a ṭhian pathumte chuan an chhâng mai ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Elihua, Barakela fapa, Buz mi, Rama thlahte zînga mi chu Joba chungah a thinur ta êm êm a, Pathian aia ṭhaah a inngaih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joba ṭhian pathumte chungah pawh a thinur bawk, Joba chu thiam lo ti chunga chhân ngaihna an hriat loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chu aia upa an nih avângin Elihua chuan Joba hnêna thu sawi ve hun chu a lo nghâk reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, hêng mi pathumte hian chhân ngaihna rêng an hre lo tih a hriatin Elihua chu a thinrim ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Barakela fapa, Elihua, Buz mi chuan heti hian a chhâng ve ta a: “Ka naupang a, nangni in upa a, chuvâng chuan ka zak a, Ka hriat pawh in kiangah ka sawi ve ngam lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Upate ṭawng sela, Rual ûten thu sawi teh se,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ni, mihringa thlarau awm, Engkimtitheia thaw chu finna petu a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kum tam apiang an fing chuang lo, Upa apiangin an hre fuh chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi ngaithla ula Ka ngaih dân ka han sawi ve ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh u, in thu ka nghâk reng a, Sawi tûr in dap chhûng khân In ṭan dânah beng ka lo chhi reng asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngun takin in thu ka ngaithla a, in zînga tu mahin Joba dik lohna in lailang thei lo va, Tu man a thu in letthla thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mihring hneh theih loh, Pathian chauh hneh theih Mi fing kan tawng ta,” in ti reu reu ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan la intawng lo va, Nangni ang mai chuan ka chhâng ve dâwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An dang reng a, chhân ngaihna an hre tawh lo va, Kam khat mah sawi tûr an nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah an ngawi reng a, sawi tûr dang rêng an hre lo va, An din reng avângin ka nghâk reng mai dâwn em ni le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin ka han chhâng ve ang a, Ka ngaih dân ka han sawi ve teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sawi tûrin ka khat tlat a, Ka chhûngrilah mi tur ut ut a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uain hu chhuahna nei lo ang ka ni, Uain thar peng angin ka puak keh ṭêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka sawi ve phawt loh chuan ka hah a dam lo vang, Ka kâ ka âng a, ka han chhâng ve teh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭan bîk neih ka tum lo va, tu mah fak der ka tum hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Fak der ka thiam lo va, chutiang chu ti ila, Mi siamtuin min la bo thuai mai ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tûnah, Joba, ka thu hi ngaithla la, Ka sawi zawng zawng hi ngun takin ngaithla rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka kâ ka âng a, Ka han sawi ve dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rilru ngîl tak pua sawi ka ni, Ka thil hriat chu dik takin ka sawi dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian Thlarau chuan mi siam a, Engkimtitheia thaw chuan nunna min pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I theih chuan mi han chhâng la, Ṭanfung siam la, mi hmachhawn teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian mit hmuhin nangmah ang bawk ka ni, Kei pawh hluma siam ve mai ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, nanghi mi hlau tûr i ni lo ve, Ka nawr lutuk lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I sawi kha ka hria a, I thute pawh ka hre reng asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Sualna rêng nei lovin ka thianghlim a, Sawisêlbo ka ni a, khawlohna lakah ka fihlîm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka lakah chhuanlam a zawng a, A hmêlmaah mi chhiar ta a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ke kawl min buntîr a, Ka awm dân tinrêng mi enthla reng,” i ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka hrilh a che, he thilah hian i tidik lo, Pathian chu mihring aiin a ropui zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kam khat maha a chhân loh che avângin Engah nge ani chu i hau le.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathianin kawng hrang hrangin thu a sawi a, Mahse, mihringin an hrethiam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tui taka mi an muthilha, Khumlaizâwla an mut laiin Mumangah te, inlârnaah te an hnênah thu a sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An beng chu a tihawng a, A zilhhauna avângin an thlaphâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihring chu a thiltih a ṭhulhtîr a, Chapona lakah a vêng him a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu thlâna liam lo tûr leh, A nunna pawh khandaiha thi lo tûrin a vêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chu natna khumah thunun a ni a, A ruh na pawh a reh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chaw châkna rêng a nei lo va, Sa tuihnai takte pawh a châk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chêr êm êm a, Ruh hlîr ruh hlîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan mitthi khua a hnaih ta hle a, A nunna chu an lâksak ṭêp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A lamṭang tûr Vântirhkoh sâng zînga pakhat tal, Mihring tih tûr dik tak hrilhtu awm teh sela!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah duhsak takin, “Mitthi khuaah kaltîr teh suh, A tlanna man ka hmu ta e,” ti se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A tisa chu lo tuai thar leh sela, A vânglai nite chu lo inher kîr leh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian hnênah a ṭawngṭai ang a, a lo duhsak ang a, Pathian hmêl chu hlim takin a hmu ang a, Chhan chhuah a nih thu chu mite hnênah a puang darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Thil dik ti lovin thil sual ka lo ti ta a, Mahse, ka phu angin ka tuar si lo,” Tiin vântlâng zîngah hla a sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, mitthi khuaa liam mai tûr a chhanhim a, A nunin khaw êng a hmu leh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pathianin hêng thil zawng zawng hi Mihring tân vawi hnih vawi thum a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thlân kotlâng aṭangin a nunnate a hruai kîr a, Nun hlimnate a neihtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />E, Joba, ngun takin mi ngaithla teh, Ngawi la, ka han sawi zêl ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sawi tûr i nei ve a nih leh mi chhâng la, Eng mah zêp suh, i dikzia hriat ka châk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Sawi tûr i nei lo a nih leh mi ngaithla la, Lo ngawi la, finna ka zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Elihua chuan a sawi zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangni mi fingte u, ka thu ngaithla ula, Nangni mi thiamte u, in beng lo dawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kâin tui a hria a, Bengin thu ṭha leh ṭha lo a hria
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dik chu thlang ila, Kan tâna ṭha ṭha chu i thlang. tlâng ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joba chuan, “Mi ṭha ka ni a, Mahse, Pathianin ka dikna mi hnâwlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka dik reng chu dawtheiah min puh a, Bawhchhe lo pui tihdam rual lohvin min hliam hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Joba anga mi hmusit chîng Tu nge awm ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil sual titute nên inkâwma, Mi sualte nêna lêng ho ṭhîn chu tu nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Pathian tihlâwm tum hi mihring tân Hlâwkna eng mah a awm lo,” a ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni mi fingte u, Pathian chuan thil sual tiin Engkimtitheia chuan thil dik lo a ti teuh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An thiltih ang zêlin mite a thungrûl a, An phu tâwk ang zêlin mi tin a rêlsak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathianin thil sual a ti hauh lo vang, Engkimtitheia chuan dik lo takin a rêl hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu nge leilungah hian thu neihtîra, Khawvêl pum pui hi kawltîrtu chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thlarau chu a lâk kîra, A thaw chu a lâksak chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng hi an boral ang a, Mihring chu vaivutah a kîr leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hriatthiamna i neih chuan hei hi ngaithla la, Ka sawi hi ngaihtuah ngun ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thu dik hawtu chuan ro a rêl ang maw? Mi dik leh thiltitheia chu i thiam lo dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chuan lal chu, “Tlâktlailopa” a ti a, Mi ropui pawh, “Mi sualpa,” a ti ngam bawk asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hotute pawh a duhsak bîk lo va, Mi hausa pawh rethei aiin a ngaihsak chuang lo va, A kutchhuak vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zânlaiah an thi thut a, Pathianin a sawisa a, An boral a, Mi chakte pawh mihring kut hmang lova lâk bo an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihringte awm dân a hmu vek a, An thiltihte a en reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thilsualtitute bihrûkna tûr Thim chhah tâwk a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihring chunga a rorêl hun tûr Pathianin tu mah a ruatsak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi ropuite a titlâwm a, an aiah mi dang a dah a, A tân an chanchin chhui lâwk a ṭûl lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An thiltihte chu a hriat reng avângin Zânah anni chu a paihthla a, a nuai bo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />An sual avângin Mite mit hmuhah anni chu a hrem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An pên bosan avâng leh A dânte an pawisak loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian hriat khawpin retheite an rûmtîr a, Hnehchhiahte au thâwm chu a lo hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A ngawih reng pawhin tu nge dem thei ang? A hmêl a thup laiin tu nge hmu thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi mal chungah pawh, hnam chungah pawh, Thuhmun rengin a che. Pathian hre lo mi chuan ro a rêl lohna tûr leh, Mipui an bum lohna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Miin Pathian hnênah hetiangin sawi sela, “Thununna ka tuar a, ka sual zui tawh lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka hmuh theih loh chu mi zirtîr la, Ka lo tihsual chu ka ti leh tawh ngai lo vang,” ti sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Pathian thiltih i do si a, I duh angin tihtîr i tum em ni? Ka hrilh ang che ni lovin, Nangmah ngeiin thu titlu rawh. I rin dân tak chu han sawi teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hriatna neite leh mi fingte chuan Ka thu sawi hi an hriatin mi pawmpui ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Joba hi eng mah hre lovin a ṭawng mai mai a, A thu-ah hian finna a awm lo,” min tihpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Joba thu sawi hi ngaihtuah ngun teh u, Mi sual angin thu a sawi mai mai a ni tih in hre thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A sual belhchhahin a hel a, Kan hmuhah hmusit takin Pathian kut a ben khum a, A âng chiam a nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihua chuan a sawi zêl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Pathian hmaah mi dik ka ni,” i ti hi A âwm i ti em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Thil sual ka ti emaw, ti lo emaw I tân eng nge pawi ang a, Ka tân eng nge hlâwkna awm ang?” i ti elo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka han chhâng teh ang che, Nang leh i ṭhiante nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vân lam khi en teh, chhûmte khi thlîr la, Nang aia a sân zâwk khi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil i tihsual pawhin i tân eng nge pawi? I bawhchhiatna a tam pawhin eng nge a pawina?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I dik pawhin eng nge i tân a ṭangkaina? I kut aṭangin eng nge a dawn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I sualna chuan mihring chauh a ni a khawih, I ṭhatna pawh mihring tân mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tihduhdahna a nasat chuan mi an rûm a, Mi thiltitheite laka chhan chhuah an ngên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahse, tu man, “Min siamtu Pathian chu khawiah nge, Zâna hla min saktîrtu chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leia ramsate aia hriatna thûk zâwk min petu, Chunglêng savate aia finga min siamtu chu?” an ti ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng alâwm, miten Pathian chu au mah se a chhân loh, Mi sualte chapona avâng chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pathianin dîlna a chhâng lo, Engkimtitheian a ngaihsak hek lo,” Tih hi a va ho tak êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ani chu ka hmu thei lo,” i ti na a, Nghâk fan fan rawh, I chungthu chu ngaihtuah tûrin a hmaah a awm e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tûnah, thinrimin a rawn hrem mai loh avâng leh, Sualna a rawn ngaimawh mai loh avângin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joba hian a kâ a âng mai mai a, Eng mah hre lovin a ṭawng mai mai a nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihua chuan a sawi zêl a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rei lo tê tal min ngaithla la, ka han hrilh ang che. Pathian hmingin sawi tûr ka la nei cheu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hriatna ka han fawmkhâwm vek teh ang, Mi siamtu dikzia chu ka târlang dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thu sawi hi dâwt a ni lo tih hre rawh, Hriatna kawnga mi puitling i kiangah a awm reng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chu a chak a, tu mah a hmusit lo, Engkim a hre vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi suaksualte a zuah lo va, Hnehchhiahte dik takin ro a rêlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalṭhutthlêngah lal angin a ṭhuttîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, miten kawl an bun a, Hnehchhiahna hruia phuar an lo nih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An thil tih leh an bawhchhiatna a hriattîr a, An lo chapo ṭhinzia te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zilhna ngaithla tûrin a hrilh a, An sual sim tûrin thu a pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu awih taka a rawng an bâwl chuan, An damchhûng chu hmuingîl takin an awm ang a, Nuamsa takin an awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ngaihthlâk loh erawh chuan khandaiha thah an ni ang. Tu ma hriat hlawh lovin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian zah lote chu an thinur ṭeuh reng a, A hrem lai pawhin ṭanpui dîlin an au duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An vânglai takin an thi ang a, Mualpho takin an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuarna hmangin Pathianin mi a zirtîr a, Harsatnain an beng a tihvârsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan manganna hmun ata a hruai chhuak che a, Hmun thâwl takah thawveng takin a awmtîr che, Thil tui tinrêng a hlui ta che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, nang chuan i sual man i tuar ta a, Dik taka rorêlsak i nih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hausak châknain hruai bo che suh se, Thamna tam tak avângin bumin awm suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I hausakna leh i chakna zawng zawng chu I mangan loh phah dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zân chu nghâkhlel suh, mite an awmna hmuna an boral hun a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sual lam âwn lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh, Thil sual i tih loh nân a ni hrehawm i tuar hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ngai teh, Pathian chu thiltithei chungchuang a ni, Zirtîrtu ropui ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu nge a thil tih dân tûr ruahmansaka, “I ti dik lo a ni,” ti thei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thiltih ropui tak hi hre reng la, Miten fakna hlain an chawimawi ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi tinin chu chu an en a, Hla tak aṭang chauhvin an thlîr ta ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pathian ropuizia hi kan hre sêng lo a ni, Engtia upa nge a nih chhui chhuah rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tui mal far tê tê chu a hîp chho va, Tui hu chu ruahtui thiangah a chantîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Vân aṭangin a sûrtîr a, Mihring tân a sûrtîr buan buan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chhûm insemdarh dânte hi mihringin a hre thei em? A awmna hmun ata khawpui a rîktîr dur dur dânte hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngai teh, chung lamah khian kâwl a phettîr zawr zawr a, Tuifinriat mawngte chu a thim tlat si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hêng hi hnamte rem a ruatsak dân a ni. Tichuan, ei tûr tam tak a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ṭêk chu a hûm reng a, A tum tak fuh tûrin a tlâktîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khawpui ri hum hum chuan thlipui lo thleng tûr a entîr a, Ran rualte pawhin a lo hnaih tawhzia an hria.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei vâng hian ka khûr a, Ka thin a phu hlawp hlawp a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngun takin ngaithla teh, a awrâwl ri hum hum te, A ka aṭanga thâwm nasa tak lo chhuakte chu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vân hnuai hmun tinah kâwl a phêttîr a, Leilung hmun tin a fang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hnuah chuan a awrâwl a chhuah a, A aw ropui tak chu a ri hum hum a. Kâwl a phe zawr zawr reng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chuan mak takin khawpui a tiri a, Thil ropui tak, kan hriatthiam phâk loh a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vûr hnênah, “Leiah tla rawh,” a ti a, Chutiangin ruahpuivânâwn hnênah, “Sûr buan buan rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tinrêng kut a chelhsak a, Ama tih a ni tih mi zawng zawngin an hriat nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ramsaten bihrûkna an zawng a, An chênna pûkah te an tawm reng mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chhim lam aṭangin thlipui a lo thawk a, Hmâr lam aṭangin thli vâwt a lo tleh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thaw chuan vûr tlang a siam a, Tuipui zau tak tak pawh a tikhang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chhûm chhahpui chu tui a paitîr a, Chhûm zîngah chuan kâwl a phêttîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A thupêk angin an de zawr zawr a, Khawvêl pum puiah a thu angin thil an ti zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihring hrem nân emaw, leilung tihṭhat nân emaw A duhsakna lantîr nân emaw chûng chu a hmang fo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Joba, hei hi lo ngaithla teh, Beng sikin Pathian thil tih makte chu ngaihtuah teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathianin chhûm a thunun dân leh kâwl a phêttîr dân hi i hria em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khua a dur dân te, Hriatna famkim neitu thil tih makte hi i hre pha em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhim thli lum a lo tleh a, I kawrte chu i thlanin a huh zo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani angin vân i kaipharh thei em ni? Ngên tlang anga khauh chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hmaa kan sawi tûr chu min hrilh rawh le, Thimin min tuam a, sawi tûr ahleih kan hriat loh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei chuan a hnêna thu sawi ka ngam lo vang, Min tihchhiat theihna kawng ka siam dâwn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûnah vâna êng khi a tle sur a, A ên êm avângin kan en ngam lo. Thliin vân chu a chhêm veng ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmâr lamah mawi takin a lo êng a, Pathian chu ropui râpthlâk takin a lo kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Engkimtitheia, hriat phâk lohva chu a ropui êm êm a, Dik takin ro a rêl a, hleih a nei lo. Tu mah a hnehchhiah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, miten amah an ṭih a, Intifingte erawh chu tu mah a pawisa lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan thlipui aṭangin Joba chu heti hian a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Eng mah hre si lovin engtizia nge ka remruat i sawi nawi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipa takin i puan ven sawi chhîng la, Thu ka zâwt ang che a, mi chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung nghahchhan ka phûm lai khân khawiah nge i awm? I hriat takmeuh chuan han sawi teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A len dân tûrte tu nge ruahman i hre meuh maw? A nih leh, a zauzâwng tu nge ruat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng chungah nge a innghaha, Tu nge a kil lung phûmtu chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zîng lam arsite an kal dual dual a, Pathian fate hlim taka an au kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipui chu a awmna ata A lo len dûl dûl lai chuan tu nge lo dang chat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A silhfên atân chhûm ka siam a, Thim chhah takin ka tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chîm chin tûrte ka ruat a, A danna leh khârna tûrte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Heti thleng chauh hi lo kal la, pêl hauh suh, Hetah hian i fâwn vêl tâwp rawh se,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I pian chinah khua vâr tûrin thu i pe ngai em? A vâr ṭanna hmun tûr i hrilh ngai em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lei chungah khua vârtîrin An bihrûkna ata mi sualte chu i lailang ngai em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khaw êngah chuan leia tlâng leh ruamte a lang fiah a, Puan angin a ze chân buai mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi sualte tân khaw lo êng chu a êng lutuk a, Pawi rêng an khawih ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipui lo irh chhuahna hnâr i tlawh tawh em? Li mawng thûk laite i dai tawh em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mitthi khaw luhna leh thim mup luhna kawngka chu I hmu tawh ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lei zauziate hi i hre phâk em? I hriat chuan han sawi teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Êng awmna in kawng chu khawiah nge? Khawiah nge thim chu a awm ṭhin?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An kalna tûr thlenga hruaiin An in lamah i hruai hâwng leh thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hria ang chu! Chûngah chuan i piang tawh a, I upat tawh êm hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Vûr dahkhâwmna i tlawh tawh em? Rial kal khâwmna in pawh i hmu tawh em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Buai hun atânte leh indo leh inbeih nia hman atân Chûng chu ka khêk a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Êng hi engtizia nge a ṭaidarha, Khawchhak thli pawh lei chunga a insem darh le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu nge tuihâwk luanna kawrte sial a, ṭêk kalkawng siam le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mihring chên lohna ram leh thlalêr, Mi awm lohna hmunah tu nge ruah sûrtîra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ram ro leh pilril tihnâwnga, Hnimhringte tu nge ṭotîr?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ruahin pa a nei em ni? Daifîm hi tu hrin nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tu chhûl aṭangin nge vûr a lo chhuah? Vân aṭanga vûr lo tla ṭhîn hi tu hrin nge?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tui khalte chu lung ang maiin a sak a, Tuithûkpui chungte pawh a khal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siruk hi i phuar khâwm theiin Chhohreivûng khi i phelh darh thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Arsite khi a hun takah i chhuahtîr theiin Zângkhua leh a bâwmtute khi i hruai thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chung lam vân awm dânte khi i hria em? Leiah hian an dânte chu i chhawr thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nan tûr chein, ruahpuivânâwn, Chhûm aṭangin i ko thla thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kâwlphete chu i hnêna lo kal tûra thu pein “Heta hi ka awm,” an rawn ti dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuivalawngin engtin nge lui lian tûr a hriat? Arpa pawhin khaw chêng tûr engtin nge a hriat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tu nge chhûmte fawm khâwm thiama, Vân tuizêmte leihbaw thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Vaivutte a inhlâwm khâwma, Lei tlangte a inbelhbawm hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sakeibakneipui chaw i zawnsakin A no hruaite kham khawp chaw i pe thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An pûkahte an bawk a, Seh tûr châng laite chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Choak chaw zawng vâk vêl te, An noten chaw dîla Pathian hnêna an hrâmte hian Tu nge ei tûr pe?
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sathâr no neih hun i hria em? Sazuk no nei lai i hmu em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An pai chhûng thla zât chhiarin an hrin hunte i hria em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An bawk a, nau an vei a, An hring mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An note chu an pian a tlang a, Ramhnuaia ṭhang lianin an tla hrang a, An puite hnênah an kîr leh tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram sabengtung chu tu nge sezâwl chhuah? A duh duhin tu nge tlattîr?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An awm nân thlalêr ka ruatsak a, Chên nân chi tamna ram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawpui hulûm engah mah a ngai lo va, Tu man an khawi ngamin an chhawr ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tlatna chu tlângpui dung a ni a, Hnimhring peh tûr a zawng zêl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sele-pa chu i chhawr thei dâwn em ni? I ran inah a riak duh meuh ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei let tûrin hrui i bahtîr thei ang em? I hnungah a ruam lai a rawn hrût rual ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A chak êm avângin a tha chu rinpuiah i hmangin I hna hahthlâk a kovah i nghat thei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I buh i sengtîr thei dâwn em ni? I hruiha buh a khungsak ang che maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ostrich chuan nasa takin a thla a zâp thei a, Mahse, kânghlai angin a thlâwk thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leiah a tui a phûm a, Vaivut chuan a khuh lum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Miin an rap keh thei a, Ramsaten an chîl keh thei tih a dâwn pha lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A no ni lo ang hrimin a ngaihsak lo va, A hahpuina chu thlâwn mah se pawi a ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathianin finna a pe lo va, Hriatthiamna a pêk hek loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlân tûra a han intihpuk meuh chuan, Sakawr leh a chungchuangte pawh a thamlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakawr hi i tihchak em ni? A tuang hi i siamsak a ni a maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khau anga kat tûrin i siam em ni? A hnâr tum dur durte hi a hlauhawm a nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ruamah a ke phiatin a inhrosa a, Indona hmunah a tlân lût ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hlauh rêng a nei lo va, a zâm ngai lo, Khandaih lakah a tîm ngai bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A chungah thal bâwm a ri rawk rawk a, Fei leh thal a tle zawr zawr mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thatho takin a lîm puat puat a, Tawtawrâwt thâwmah a zauthau va, A awm hle hle thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt a rîk phawt chuan a hnâr a tum a, Indo thâwm chu hla tak aṭangin a hre thei, Hotute au leh an haw haw chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vân sânga mu thlâwkte khi i zirtîr em ni? Chhim lam hawia an thla an zârte hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I thupêkin em ni muvânlai a invânvawrha, Sâng taka bu a chheh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khâmahte a chêng a, Lungpui kehkâr hmun himahte a riak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chuta ṭang chuan ei tûr a mitmei a, hla tak tak a hmu phâk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A notê pawhin thisen an dâwt a, Saruang awmnaah an awm khâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Joba hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Sawisêltu, Engkimtitheia chu i hnial ang maw? Pathian hnialtu, i chhâng zêl dâwn em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kei mi tlâktlailo tak hian Engtin nge ka chhân theih ang che? Ka kâ ka hup mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vawi khat ka sawi tawh a, ka chhâng tawh lo vang che, A ni, ka sawi nawn dâwn tawh lo.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thlipui aṭangin Joba chu a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipa takin i puanven sawi chhîng la, Thu ka zâwt ang che a, mi chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ti dik lovah min puh dâwn em ni? Thiam i chan theih nân Thiam loh min chantîr dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian angin i chak em ni? A aw anga ring aw i nei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuti a nih chuan intiropuiin intizahawm la, Mawi tak leh ropui takin inthuam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi chapote chu en la, An chungah i thinur nasa tak chu leih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi chapote chu en bîkin titlâwm la, Mi sualte chu an awmhmunah rap hrep ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An vaiin leiah phûm khâwm la, Thlânah an hmaite tuam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, i kut ding lamin mahni i inchhan thei tih Kei pawh hian ka hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En teh, Behemot hi, nangmah ang bawka Ka kutchhuak a nih hi. Bâwng angin hnimhnah a ei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A chakna chu a kâwngah a awm a, A thahrui chu a dul thuarah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A mei chu sidar thing angin a tikhauh va, A malpui thate pawh a phiar tlat mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ruhte chu ngên kawrawng anga khauh a ni a, A kête pawh thîr tlâwn ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian thil siam zîngah a pui ber a, A siamtu chauhvin khandaihin a vau bet thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tlângah te a peh tûr hnim a ṭo va, Tah chuan, ram sakawlhte an tualchai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lotus hlîngnei buk hnuaiah a bawk a, Phairuang dûm zîngahte a biru ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotus buk chuan a hliah a, Lui kam tuipuisuthlah chuan a zâr hlim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tui lian so bulh bulh chu a hlau lo va, A ka chîm khawpin Jordan lian mah se a pawisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A mit tuamin tu nge man thei ang? A hnârah tu nge thil tlang thei ang?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nghakuaiin Leviathan i âwk thei em ni? Hruihrualin a lei i phuar thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnârah hrui i thil tlang thei em? Thîr kawmin a khabe-ah i thil thei em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawngaih a dîl dâwn che em ni? Hawihhâwm takin a bia ang che maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dam chhûnga i chhiahhlawha awm tûrin Thu a thlunpui ang che maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sava angin i khawi ngam thei ang em? I fanute chaih atân i hlîng thei ang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sangha mantuten indâwr nân an hmang em ni? Sumdâwngtuten lei atân an chan darh dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vunah feikibâr te, a lu-ah nghafei te I riah thei em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A chungah kut han thlâk teh rêng, A hlauhawmzia i hria ang a, I ti leh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani tihtlâwm tum chu beidawnthlâk tak a ni, A hmêl mai pawh a râpthlâk êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah cho tho tûrin tu mah huai tâwk an awm lo, Chuti a nih si chuan tu nge min do ngam ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu nge ka rulh leh tûra thil min pe hmasa? Vân hnuaia thil engkim hi ka ta asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leviathan fuke chu ka han sawi zêl teh ang, A chakzia leh a pian thiamzia te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu nge a vun pâwnlâng pawt hîk thei ang? Tu nge a vunpui tipawp thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu nge a kâ keu ânga, A ha kual kulh hlauhawm tak chu keu lang ngam ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A phuhlip inthuah tup chu a chhuan ber a ni, A insi phui tlat a, lung ang maia sak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A insîk phui tlat avângin A kârah boruak pawh a lût thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A inzawm a, a inchâr tlat a, Kaih ṭhen theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hahchhiau chuan êng a phuh chhuak a, A mitte chu khawfîngchat ang rû a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A kâ aṭangin mei alh a chhuak a, Meisîte a ṭêk ur ur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnâr aṭang chuan meikhu a lo chhuak a, Sa so bêl nghawr leh phairuang mût ang vut vut a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meihawl a chhêm vâm a, A kâ aṭangin meialh a lo chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A nghâwng tha chu a chak êm a, A tawk apiang hlauvin an khûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A vunah nêm lai rêng a awm lo va, Thîr anga sak a ni, vih pawh rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thinlung chu thîr anga sak a ni, Râwtsawmna lung hnuai zâwk anga chang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lo thawh meuh chuan mi chakte pawh an khûr a, An hlau va, an thla a bâr zo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khandaihin sât mah se, pem pawh a pem lo vang, fei te, thal te, feiṭam te chuan a chhun thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thîrte chu buhpâwl ang lekah a ngai a, Ngênte pawh thing mawih angah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thal hlauvin a tlânchhe ngai lo va, Sairawkherha perh pawh favaia theh ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Talhtum chu buhpâwl ang lekin a ngai a, Thal ri rawk rawk pawh a thamlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dul phuhlip chu lampei anga hriam a ni a, Mawiin lei a hrût angin chirhdiak zîngah a tâl vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tui thûk tak chu bêl angin a tiso buah buah a, Tuipui chu bêlte angin a tiphûl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kalna chu a vâr ruah a, Tuipui phuan vâr emaw an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leiah hian amah ang rêng an awm lo va, Eng mah hlauh nei lova siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ramsa ngêng tak takte chu a thamlo va, Inluling tak takte chungah a lêng a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Joba chuan Lalpa chu a chhâng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Engkim i tithei tih ka hria, I tum chu dâl rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eng mah hre si lo hian engtizia nge I remruat hi ka lo sawisêl mai le! Ka hriatthiam lohte chu ka lo sawi a ni, Ka hriat phâk loh, ka tâna mak lutukte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I sawi ngaithla tûr leh I zawhna chhâng tûrin min ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi sawi aṭang chauhvin ka lo hria che a, Mahse, tûnah zawng ka mit ngeiin ka hmu ta che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvâng tak chuan ka inten a, Vut leh vaivuta ṭhuin ka sim ta e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Joba hnêna hêng thu hi a sawi zawhin, Elifaza, Teman mi hnênah, “I chungah leh i ṭhian pahnihte chungah ka thin a ur hle a ni. Ka chhiahhlawh Joba angin ka chungchâng thu dik takin in sawi si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, bâwngpa pasarih leh berâmpa pasarih keng ula, ka chhiahhlawh Joba hnênah va kal ula, in tân hâlral thilhlan va hlân rawh u. Tin, ka chhiahhlawh Joba chuan a ṭawngṭaisak ang che u a, a dîl angin ka lo pawmsak ang a, in âtzia ang zêl chuan ka thungrûl lo vang che u, ka chhiahhlawh Joba angin ka chungchâng thu dik takin in sawi si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Elifaza, Teman mi te, Bildada, Sua mi te, Zofara, Naama mi te chu an va kal a, Lalpa thupêk ang zêl chuan an ti a. Tin, Lalpa chuan Joba dîlna chu a ngaithla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joban a ṭhiante a ṭawngṭaisak hnuin Lalpa chuan Joba chu a tiṭha a, a hmaa a neih lêt hnih a pe leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a unaute leh a farnu zawng zawngte, tûn hmaa a hmêlhriat zawng zawngte chu a hnênah an lo kal a; a inah chawhlui an kîl ho va. Lalpa chuan a chunga thil ṭha lo a thlentîr avângte chuan pawi an tihzia an hrilh a, an thlamuan a. Mite chuan tangkaraw tlang te, rangkachak zungbunte an pe ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Joba hun hnuhnûng chu a hun hmasa aiin nasa takin mal a sâwm a. Berâm sîngkhat leh sângli, sanghâwngsei sângruk, bâwng tuak sângkhat, sabengtungpui sângkhat a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fapa pasarih leh fanu pathum a nei bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A fanu upa ber hmingah Jemimai a sa a, a dawttu hmingah Keziaii, a pathumna hmingah Keren-hapuki a sa ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram zawng zawngah pawh Joba fanute anga nula hmêlṭha an awm lo. An pa chuan anni chu an nuṭate nên ro chan tûr a siamsak ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hemi hnu hian Joba chu a dam zêl a, kum za leh sawmli a dam a ni. A fapa te, a tupa te, chhuan li thlengin a hmu phâk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Joba chu upa tak, tarkûna damin a thi ta a.
  </para>
</usx>
